<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">- Kuman New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Ka Di Poglkwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ka Di Poglkwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ka Di Poglkwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ka Di Poglkwa</para>
  <para style="mt">Ka Di Poglkwa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="s">Ka Bre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Ka magigl paugwa i, Jisas Krais ka di nogugl ede norukwa paugwa. Ana siragl tau tabre plau dinaiglkwa paugwa i, God ere mogl, Jisas di togwa. Ye Jisas di togwa i, Jisas prisre, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba di tenabedi ye di togwa. Ana God ye ka i Jisas di togo, Jisas ere mogl, angelo ta dedugo, angelo i na Jon, Jisas niglmo kogonmo yoba moglka i, di pogl narukwa. <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />Di pogl naruko, na bogl atne ediga. God kamo siragl mere paugwa i, ya te Jisas Krais ka siragl mere di nogugl ede narukwa i ya te, na siragl taragl kandre, prisre, erika i, erme na kuno ere ene di tenagledi bogl atne ediga.<verse eid="REV 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Na God kamo kep ere boglka magigl i, yoba ta ka i, i pi yoba pere kere tenabuka yobamo i God ye ere wakai ere tedre, yoba ta ka i prisre, duglo boraiglkwa i, God ye ama ere wakai ere tenabuka. Na taragl mudu boglka i, tabre plau dinabuka pre ka i kere prio.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="REV 1:4-5" />Ene God yobama, provins Esia suna, taun kade 7-pela yomara suna meglkwa i, Na Jon, pepa magigl i, ene bogl teiga. Na prika i, God ya Jisas Krais yebr, te, God Murubuglo ye yobuglomo 7-pela paugwa moglkwa i, ye pra pra ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere tedre, deno muduno wida di padigl tenaiglmedi prika. God moglkwa i, ye okna ibo aimadi kamun moglsre, erme ama mogl pai moglsre, okuo yene ama unabuka. God Murubuglomo ye yobuglo 7-pela paugwa molkwa i, ye God siamo king yomara gumamugl moglkwa. Te, Jisas Krais moglkwa i, ye God kamo pamere di norukwa yagle moglkwa. Ye komnaye kana goglsre, adigl u kor ogwa te, erme king makandigle meglkwa i mudu i swara ede, Yaglno Kade moglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4-5">Ana nono aimadi kamin Jisas kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Nono tadaglme erumga pre kane pamgo, ye dem muduo norsre, ye bormaimo suru edumara i mina nono i meda edugwa. <verse eid="REV 1:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />Te, ye nono kingno mogl, suglno moglmara nono i suna edidre, tawa teigwa yoba kogon erimere mere yegl, Jisas Nem God moglkwa i, nono ye kogonmo ere tenaiglmedi norukwa. Yegl pre ye kagie kade aimadi kamun tedre, ye nono Yaglno Kade moglmedi debie si pai moramga.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Ene kanio! Jisas kamun kua mina ibo ede ikne unan, yoba mudu ye kanaiglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Daniel 7.13</char></note> Ye kuglage sigwa yobamo i ye umiwedi kanibi, te yoba yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ye umiwedi kan, kudugl goglsre, kai podo eraiglkwa. Ye yegl mere unabuka. Kaima.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sekaraia 12.10</char></note><verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />Yagl Kade God yegl dugwa, Na moglka i, na taragl mudu plau dinabedi ersre, te, na taragl mudu ama si dudinaglka moglka. Na okna ibo aimadi kamun moglsre, erme ama mogl pai moglsre, te okuo na nana unaglka moglka. Na yobuglna pai kawa togwa moluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jon ye Jisas Krais kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Na Jon moglka i, ene agro moglko, nono Jisas yobama munga i pre nono akie yubun idre, giugl akie prumga. Te, God nono kingno moglsre, suglno moglmara i, nono suna akie munga. Te, yubun imga igne akie adigl gigledi munga. Na God kamo yoba beke tedre, Jisas kamo yoba di pogl teiga i pre yoba na si kane si i pi ailan ta kagie Patmos we dimara i, edigo, na ailan Patmos suna i moglsre, ene pepa i bogl teiga.<verse eid="REV 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Ana ege swara ta Sunde ege Yaglno Kade egemo yogo, God Murubuglomo na moglmara si kau si naruko, na moknamugl i, yoba ta ka dugwa ba ye ka dugwa i, biugel be podo dumere mere yegl ka podo kide dugwa. <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />Ye dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Ene siragl taragl ta kanatnga i, mudu buk mina bogl atne edidre, yoba ten, ye i pi pre mediglkwa yoba taun 7-pela makai sinaglmara i tebi, kerinaiglmiwe dugwa. Taun 7-pela i, Efesus ya Smerna ya Pergamum ya Taiataira ya Sardis ya Filadelfia ya Laodisia pre diwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Lampstands" file="bk00154b.tif" size="col" copy="Bass/Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="1.12" />Ana na ira dumada di, na kan ake te, kaniga i, ken lam gol mina bekigwa 7-pela yogo, kaniga. <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />Te, lam 7-pela yomara suna i, yoba ta adigl moglko, kaniga. Na ye kaniga i, ye Yoba Wam we dumga i moglkwa mere yegl kaniga. Ye gagl suna olto edidre, kumagl ta gol mina bekigwa i pirie mina de prak sugwa. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Te, ye bre ya bre yugo i, kamin kua kruo pe sumere mere mo sipsip kruo yugono pe sumere yegl mere pe kaima sugwa. Sugo, ye gumuglo i, doga bauglo abuglage sumere mere yegl abuglage sugwa. <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />Ye yegl mere moglko, na kandre, ye kagle ama pogl dumedi kaniga. Yoba ain bras doga mina gaglsre, ake wige digo, pogl dumere mere yegl pogl dugwa. Te, ye ka dugwa i, nigl podo kide ta mu dumere mere yegl ka podo kaima dugwa. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Ye ogo wo kra, kugl kuri 7-pela ake moglsre, dra mina bainet ta ikne ikne nogwa ede meda ugwa. Te, ye guma dra ade ermine sumere mere abuglage podo sugo, na kaniga.<verse eid="REV 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Ana na yagl i kandre, yage kagle mina si, yoba geglkwa pai meglmere mere yegl pai moglka. Na yegl erika ba ye ogo wo mina na akidre, na yegl di narukwa, Ene kudugl goglkro! dugwa. Na moglka i, taragl mudu plau dinabedi ersre, te, na taragl mudu ama si dudinaglka moliwa. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Na kor moglka. Na okna goglka ba ene kano! Na erme moglsre, te aimadi kamin ama kor mogl pai moraliwa. Te, yoba goraiglkwa mo kor moraiglkwa i, na nem yagl moglsre, yoba goglsre, ede aglo mere enaiglkwa i ama nem yagl moluwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Yegl pre ene taragl tau kan kodinere yegl bogl atne edidre, te taragl tau erme plau dugwa i ya te, taragl tau okuo plau dinabuka i mudu bogl atne edo dugwa.<verse eid="REV 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Yagl i yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ogona wo mina kugl kuri 7-pela ake moglko, ene kanga i, ka padum mere paugo, mabunomo yegl mere paugwa. Pre mediglkwa yoba taun 7-pela makai si meglmara suna i, yagl 7-pela ene motnara unaiglmedi dedigo, u meglkwa i, kugl kuri i, ka padum mere yegl yagl 7-pela i, i nogugl edugwa. Te, ken lam 7-pela kanga i, pre mediglkwa yoba taun 7-pela makai si meglkwa ikra, i nogugl edumiwe di, yegl di narukwa.<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <figure style="fig" alt="Seven churches" file="Map_Seven Churches_Kuman.jpg" size="span" copy="FMOsoft" ref="2.0" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Efesus pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere na di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Efesus makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Efesus yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">Ye yegl di kodidre, yegl dugwa, Na kugl kuri 7-pela ogona wo mina ake idre, lam gol 7-pela yeimara suna wan u ikne ikne eiga yagl moglka i, ene pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Efesus meglkwa i, yegl di teiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ene mabuno siragl mere erikwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Ene kogon podo ersre, ege kide yogwa igne ama adigl gigledi meglkwa i, na prika. Te, ene makai simara suna i, yoba kide udre, ka kane kane dinamnedi eriko, ene kanige erekrikwa i, na ama priwe dugwa. Yoba tau ka kibi didre, Jisas dedugwa yoba muniwe digwa i, ene ye doko kan, ka kibi dimiwedi kandre, <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />te na pre ene yubun igwa ba adigl gigledi mogl, oglka erekrikwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Yagl Kade ye Efesus pre mediglkwa yoba pre ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene Efesus yoba mabuno yegl mere erikwa i, wakai erikwa. Ba ene mabuno ta erikwa aglau erukwa i, na di pogl tenagle dugwa. Ene okna deno muduno narimere yegl, erme narekrikwa pre na kide prika. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Yegl pre okna ene deno muduno narimere ikra poglo di prisre, nomano yake teo! Ene nomano yake tedre, mabuno okna erimere yegl eraiglkwa paugwa. Ta erekribi, na u ene ken lamno i eglke edenaglka. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Ba ene mabuno wakai ta erikwa i, na ama dibo, ene praiglkwa. Yoba tau Nikolas yobama we digwa, ye ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ye mabunono na kide kanimere mere yegl, ene ama kide kanigwa pre ene tau wakai erimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa paugwa. Yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka i, ede swara ta God dumomo wakaile suna paugwa i, na ye mogomo uro nenabedi tenaluwe dugwa. Ede i, yoba mogomo uro nedre, aimadi kamin wakai moraiglkwa paugwa ikra pre na diwe di, Yagl Kade yegl di narukwa.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Smerna pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Smerna makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Smerna yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">Ye yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Na taragl mudu plau dinabedi ersre, te taragl mudu si dudinaglka yagle moliwa. Te, na okna goglsre, adigl u kor eiga yagle moglka i, na ene yegl di teiwe dugwa, <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />Ene yubun tau mere idre, goduglme mere yegl meglkwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Na ene goduglme meglme diga i, mige moni ya ki ene meglmara yeikrukwa pre diga ba ene kiano mina taragl wakai wakai i kodidre, wakai meglkwa. Te, Juda yoba tau ene kenaglno si meglkwa i, na ama pre kan erika. Yoba i, ye Juda yoba meglkwa pre God yobama munedi prikwa ba ye God yobama ta moglkrikwa. Ye Satan yugobunomo mina atne moglsre, ka mabuno yugu ta makai sigwa i, Satan yugumo mina makai simiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ana ene kuri kaima ta moglsre, yubun podo ta inaiglkwa ba ene kudugl goglkrio dugwa. Ene prio! Yagl Kide ene ta eribi kanagledi pre yoba tau nomane tenan, yoba i ene tau si kane sibi, ene 10-pela de mere yubun podo inaiglkwa. Taragl yegl mere plau dinabuka ba ene na kana duglo bogl pai molo. Te, ene na pre goraiglkwa mere yegl ta panan, ama na kana kide kodokrio! Ene yegl eribi, na topo wakai ta ene tenaglka. Topo i, king bitno gagl mere yegl yogo, kagie kor kaima meglkwa bitno gagl we dimiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa paugwa. Yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka i, namba 2 dai ikra ye kuri kaima ta ere kide ere tekrabuka ba ye wakai ka kaima morabuka pre diwe di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Pergamum pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Pergamum makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Pergamum yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">Ye yegl di kodidre, yegl dugwa, Na we, bainet ta koglo koglo nogwa na drana mina ede meda ugo, moglka i, na ene yegl di teiwe dugwa, <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ene taun Pergamum meglmara i, Satan dumo i ye siamo king yogo, dumo i kide yogwa ba ene dumo kide moglsre, na duglo bogl meglkwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Te, yagl ta kagie Antipas we digwa, na kana kuno ere yoba di tedre, na kana kide kodokrukwa pre yoba Satan taunmo meglkwa i ere mogl, ye si geglkwa. Igne i, ene ama na kana kide kodokre, Jisas pre meduniwe di, nogugl di pai meglkwa i, na priwe, dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Yagl Kade ye Pergamum yoba pre ka yegl mere di narsre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene yegl erikwa i, wakai erikwa ba ene aglau tau erikwa i, na ama di pogl tenagle dugwa. Ene pre mediglkwa yoba makai simara suna i, yoba tau ka mabuno kibi digo, ene kanige erikwa. Yoba ka mabuno kibi digwa i, ye yagl ta kagie Balam, yoba okna ibo ka beke tomere mere yegl beke teigwa. Yagl Balam i ye okna king ta kagie Balak we digwa i Israel yoba tadaglme mina yage sinaiglmedi ero dugo, Balak ye Israel yoba mie tau god kibi kagno mina teigwa i nedre, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nenaiglmedi eruko, Israel yoba kaima yage sigwa. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Ana yoba tau ene meglmara ka mabuno kibi dime diga i, yoba kagno Nikolas yobama we digwa i pre diga. Ye ene meglmara suna moglsre, mabuno kide Balam erumere mere yegl, yoba eraiglmedi beke teigwa. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Yegl pre ene nomano yake teo! Ene nomano yake tekribi, na tabre u, bainet ta ikne ikne nogwa na drana mina ede meda ugwa i mina yoba i kuda bogl tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa paugwa. Yoba ta kuda yobuglo eran, na bret ta mana we digwa ikra, teke yogwa i tebo, nenabuka. Te, na yoba i ama kagie kor ta kobuglo kruo mina bogl atne edidre, ye tenaglka. Ye kagie kor i, yoba tau ta prikraiglkwa ba ye yene prabiwe di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Taiataira pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Taiataira makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Taiataira yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">Ye yegl di kodidre, yegl dugwa, Na gumuglna doga bauglo abuglage sumere mere yegl abuglage sugo, katna ain bras ake wigo dedigwa pogl di yomere mere yegl pogl dugo, na God Wam moglka i, ene yegl di teiwe dugwa, <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ene mabuno siragl mere erikwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Ene deno muduno ikne ikne tedre, na pre medigl pai meglkwa i, na prika. Te, ene yoba pere ake ple di tenamnedi kogon podo ersre, ege kide yogwa igne adigl gigledi meglkwa i, na ama prika. Te, ene okna na kogona kunabe erikwa ba erme tau podo erikwa i, na ama pre kan eriwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Yagl Kade ye Taiataira yoba pre ka yegl mere di narsre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene yegl erikwa i, wakai erikwa ba ene aglau ta erikwa i, na ama di poragle dugwa. Abu Jesebel,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jesebel i, abu ta okna Israel kwino moglsre, abu kide kaima ta moglkwa i, kagie paugwa. Ye Israel yoba god kibi kamage ere tenaiglmedi erumere yegl, abu ta Taiataira pre mediglkwa yoba meglmara suna i ama yegl ta erukwa pre Jisas ye kagie Jesebel we dugwa mere yegl paugwa.</char></note> ye ka kep abu ta mole dugwa i, ene meglmara suna moglko, ene kanige erikwa. Abu i ye na niglna kogona yoba bakagl te, ye yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nedre, mie tau yoba god kibi kagno mina teigwa i, i nenaiglmedi obuno di togwa. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Na abu i nomane yake tedre, mabunomo kide i, kide kodinabedi sugl moglka ba ye nomanemo gigle dugwa. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Yegl pre ene prio! Na kide ta dedibo, abu i sinabuka. Te, yoba ta ye ka beke togwa i prisre, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl neigwa i ama nomano yake tekre, mabunono kide i, ere pai meglbi, ye ama yubun podo inaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Yoba i, ye abu Jesebel gagiglma mere yegl meglkwa i, yubun podo idre, nomano yake tekre pai meglbi, na ye si goraglka. Si goglbo, pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si moraiglmara i, yoba ka i dibi prisre, pre pogl sinaiglkwa i, Yagl Kade kan yoba mudu nomano ya deno muduno wagle edumiwedi, pre pogl sinaiglkwa. Te, na ene swara swarade mabuno siragl mere erimere mere kuno ere te ikne edinaluwe di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />Ene dumo Taiataira meglmara i, pre mediglkwa yoba tau ka mabuno kibi i duglo boglsre, ka i, ka atne padre, mem podo pame digwa ba ka i, Satan kamo kaima yogwa. Ba ene tau ka mabuno i ta duglo boglkrikwa i, ama ka ta di tenaglka. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ene na kana prikwa i ake gi di mogl ebi, na okuo ede ikne unaglka. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Yoba ta kuda yobuglo ersre, na mabuno ta erio dimere mere duglo bogl pai mogl, gorabuka i, na ye yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i suglno morabedi tenaglka. <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />Na Nina kagna kade narsre, yugobuno pere pere suglno moratnedi narumere yegl, na yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka yobamo i ama tebo, ye ama yegl erabuka. Ye ain kuba ta akidre, yoba plet ya kap ki si deduagle erimere yegl, yobuglo ere, ye suglno morabuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.8-9 kanio</char></note> <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />Te, na yoba i ama kugl kuri ta tagna mogl abuglage si pai moglkwa i, tenaluwe di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Sardis pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Sardis makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Sardis yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">Ye yegl di kodidre, yegl dugwa, Na God Murubuglomo 7-pela i akidre, kugl kuri 7-pela ama akiga yagle moglka i, ene pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Sardis meglkwa i, yegl di teiwe dugwa, Ene mabuno siragl mere erikwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Yoba ene kanigwa i, kor mogl, wakai meglmedi kanigwa ba ene gogl kodigwa mere yegl meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Te, ene mabunono i, na Godna gumuglo mina kuno erekrukwa. Yoba ta doga ere gaglsre, ugl paugo, eduer suna doga i goginagledi erumere yegl mere, ene mabunono wakai i, ama goginagledi erukwa pre ene adiglsre, ede tau i tebe ede galo! <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Okna ene na kana siragl mere prisre, pre mediglkwa i, ene pre moglsre, nomano yake te, na kana i ake molo. Ene na dimere yegl erekre, ugl pai meglbi, na u ene sinaglka. Kunogl gogl yoba ta ede yugugl ugo, yugu nem kandre, wai kuglmere yegl, na aunake u ene sinaglka i, ene ta prikraiglkwa pre na wibo, ene ama wai kuraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Yagl Kade ye pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Sardis meglkwa i pre ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene tau mere meglkwa i, yoba kuguglno gaglno si deglbi yeimere mere yegl, ene mabuno deglbi yogwa i erikwa. Ba yoba tau ene meglmara suna i, mabuno kide yegl ta erekre, mabuno wakai erikwa pre ye kugugl gagl kruo edibi, ye na bogl si dakagl moramga i, kuno erukwa. Kuno erukwa pre kaima yegl mere moramga. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Te, yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka i, kugugl gagl kruo yegl mere tebo, edenabuka. Ye kagie ama, yoba kor aimadi meglkwa bukmo mina God bogl atne edugwa yogwa i, na ka kaima ta ere edekraglka ba na Nina gumuglo mina ya te, ye angeloma gumuglno mina yoba i kagie di pogl tenaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Filadelfia pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Filadelfia makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Filadelfia yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">Ye yegl di kodidre, yegl dugwa, Na moglka i, dena muduna pe kaima sugo, na ka dimara ege ege adigl moglka. Te, na Devit gawamo moglka pre God yoba kingno mogl, suglno morabara i, na ki ake moglka. Na taragl ta yauro edibo, yoba ta yogiglkraiglkwa. Te, na taragl ta yogiglbo, yoba ta yauro edekraiglkwa. Na yoba yegl moglka i, ene yegl di teiwe dugwa, <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ene mabuno siragl mere erikwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Na pre kan erika i, ene yoba mere ta moglkrikwa te yobuglno podo paikrukwa ba ene na kana duglo beglkwa. Te, na kagna i ama ene mane dikre, mokono narekrikwa pre ene wakai erikwa. Yegl pre ene kanio! Ene na kogona eraiglmedi na dua ta ene yauro teiga. Yoba ta udre, dua i yogramnedi eribi, kuno ta erekrabuka. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Te, ene prio! Juda yoba tau no Juda yoba munga pre God yobama muniwe digwa ba ye ka kibi digwa. Ye kaima God yobama ta moglkre, Satan ka mabuno yugumo makai sigwa yobama meglkwa. Ba ye u ene meglmara goglkono bodugl tedre, te na ene dena muduna teiga i, ye ama pre kan eraiglmedi eraliwe, di yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Yagl Kade ye pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Filadelfia makai si meglkwa i pre ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yubun ta unan, ene adigl gigledi molo dimere yegl, ene erikwa pre ege kide ta makandigle yoba mudu meglmara unabuka i, ene suna mogl, yubun akie i dinaiglmedi ere tenaluwe dugwa. Makandigle yoba mudu ta eribi kanagledi ege kide i dedibo, ye mudu meglmara unabuka ba ene meglmara ta ukrabuka pre diga. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Na ede ikne unaglka i, magigl erukwa pre ene na mabunona erikwa i, ake gi di molo. Ake gi di meglbi, yoba swara ta ene praisno i eglke edenaiglkwa i, kuno erekrabuka.<verse eid="REV 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka i, na ere mogl, ye na Godna yugumo mina yugu kauglage mere yegl morabedi eribo, ye God yugumo yomara keme moglsre, okuo ede meda ta pikrabuka. Te, na Godna kagie i, yoba i ogono nagino mina bogl atne edidre, na kagna kor yenabuka i ama ye mina bogl atne edidre, na Godna dumomo kagie ama ye mina bogl atne edenaglka. God dumomo we diga i, Jerusalem kor heven ibo, na Godna moglmara yei, ede atne unabuka i pre diwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yagl Kade ye Laodisia pre mediglkwa yoba ka di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />Ana Yagl Kade ka yegl mere di narse, ama yegl di narukwa, Na ka erme di tenaglka i, ene bogl atne edidre, pre mediglkwa yoba dumo Laodisia makai si meglkwa i, ye yagl ta dedigo, ugwa i, u plau dinan, ene ten, ye i pi Laodisia yoba tenabiwe dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">Ye yegl di kodidre, yegl dugwa, Na moglka i, na ka kibi ta di kankre, ka kaima keme diga. Te, God kamo siragl mere dugwa i, na pamere keme ege ege ene di teiga. Te, God taragl kane kane mudu ere yogwa i, na taragl i, bitno moglka. Na yoba yegl moglka i, ene yegl di teiwe dugwa, <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="REV 3:15-16" />Ene mabuno siragl mere erikwa i, na pre kan eriwe dugwa. Na prika i, ene na mabunona kaima eramnedi prikrikwa ba ene ama na mabunona mudu kide kodokrikwa. Ene suna suna mere yegl meglkwa. Ene yegl meglkwa i, ene nigl dogwa mere yegl moglkre, nigl kor mere yegl ama moglkrikwa ba ene nigl gagl i meda edigwa, bi yomere mere yegl meglkwa. Na prika i, ene na mabunona kaima eramnedi pribi, i wakai panabuka, te ta manan, ene mudu kide kodinaiglkwa paugwa. Ba ene suna suna meglkwa i, na kide prika pre yoba nigl kobugl kar simere mere yegl, na ene sedinaluwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Yagl Kade ye Laodisia yoba pre ka yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene digwa i, No mige moni ya bona gana mere kide pai norukwa pre taragl swara ta inamga i ta paikrumiwe digwa. Ene yegl digwa ba ene goduglme mere yegl moglsre, yoba kide kaima meglkwa i, ene ta pre kan erekrikwa. Ene gumuglno ama kin yogo, yokoko meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Yegl pre na ene di teiga i, ene na moglmara udre, gol wakai, doga mina gaiglkwa, pe kaima sugwa i, topo sinaiglkwa paugwa. Ene na golna i ta topo sibi, ene goduglme moglkre, taragl wakai mere igwa mere yegl panabuka. Te, ene ama na moglmara udre, kugugl gagl kruo topo sidre, edibi, wakai panabuka. Ta manan, yoba ene yokoko meglmedi kanibi, ene agai goraiglkwa. Te, ene marasin tau topo si idre, gumuglno mina egribi, ene gumuglno wakai enan, aglke kor pene di kanaiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Ene prio! Na dena muduna teiga yoba i ta aglau erikwa igne, na ye ka tedre, ye ere si di iga. Yegl pre ene nomano yake tedre, na pre di yar edigwa i kide kodo, nigl dogwa mere yegl molo! dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Ene prio! Na yugu dua mina adigl mogl, dua sidre, ene agle di moglka mere yegl paugwa. Yoba ta na agle diga i prisre, yugu dua yauro edenan, na ede yugugl unaglka. Wibo, na yoba i bogl ame di mogl, kaya mokna akie nenabuglka.<figure style="fig" alt="Christ knocking on door" file="cn02107B.tif" size="col" loc="3.20" copy="David C. Cook" ref="3.20">3.20</figure> <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka i, na yoba i pra we di tebo, siana king mina akie ame dinabuglka. Na kuda mina yobuglo ersre, Nina siamo mina na Nina bogl akie ame dubuglere yegl, na yoba i bogl akie ame dinabuglka pre diwe di, Yagl Kade yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />Yagl Kade yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Ene pre mediglkwa yoba ta bage bage makai si meglkwa i, God Murubuglomo ene ka di togwa i ta pre pogl sinamnedi pribi, ene wakai ere kinano gudu praiglkwa pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Yoba heven ibo mogl, God kagie kade teigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Mokomugl i, na kan mitna ibo ede kaniga i, heven ibo dua ta yauro edigwa yogo, kaniga. Kanigo, Yagl Kade okna ka podo kide, biugel be podo dumere mere yegl dugwa ikra, ye aglke kor ka podo yegl mere didre, Ene ede egli wo! dugwa. Ene ede egli un, na taragl tau okuo plau dinabuka paugwa i, ene obuno di tebo, ene kanatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Yegl dugo, God Murubuglomo tabre na moglmara si kau si naruko, na kaniga i, heven ibo sia king ta yogo, yoba ta sia king i mina ame di moglko, kaniga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jon ye Yoba ta sia king mina ame di moglme dugwa i, God Nem pre dugwa. God Nem murubuglo moglko, ogo nagie ta paikrukwa ba Jon gumuglomugl erumara i, ye yoba mere yegl moglmedi kanugwa.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Yoba ta sia king mina ame di moglkwa i, ye ogo nagie pogl di yogwa. Kobuglo ta jaspa we digwa i ya kobuglo gogl ta kagie konilian we digwa i, pogl dibrere mere yegl, ye ogo nagie mina yegl pogl dugwa. Ye ogo nagie mina yegl mere pogl dugo, te, sia king yomara titokubun ta bogl winabo dugwa ba titokubun i, kala kane kane paikrukwa. Kobuglo grinpela ta kagie emeral we digwa i yomere mere, titokubun i grinpela keme boglkwa. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Te, sia king yomara i, sia 24-pela ama yei winabo digo, bitno yoba 24-pela ye sia i mina ame di meglkwa. Bitno yoba i, kugugl gagl kruo edidre, king bitno gagl gol mina bekigwa i, bitno mina edigwa.<verse eid="REV 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Ana sia king yomara kamun tai si ede meda pidre, kamun gur podo di moglkwa. Te, sia king yomara gumamugl i, ken lam 7-pela de paigwa. Ken lam 7-pela i, God Murubuglomo 7-pela i, i nogugl edigwa. <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />Te, sia king gumamugl i, taragl ta yogwa, na mudi nigl mere yegl moglmedi kaniga ba taragl i nigl moglkrukwa. Glas mere yegl yedre, ais mere yegl pogl dugwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:6">Ana sia king yomara magigl i, taragl 4-pela ama meglkwa. Ta sia king gumamugl moglko, ta mokomugl moglko, suo koglo koglo miurka. Taragl 4-pela i, mokono gumano, ogono nagino mina i, mudu gumuglno pai poria erukwa. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Taragl 4-pela meglkwa i, ta komono moglkwa i, laion mere yegl moglkwa. Ta namba 2 moglkwa i, kau nagigle mere yegl moglkwa. Ta namba 3 moglkwa i, yoba gumano drano kunere mere yegl koglko, namba 4 moglkwa i, kua kigla mere yegl moglsre, pur dumedi kaniga. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Taragl 4-pela i, ye mudu koyeno 6-pela paugo, ogono nagino mudu ya koyeno atne i ama gumuglno pai poria erukwa meglkwa. Ye etne ya eduer ka ege ege di moglsre, yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Yagl Kade God, ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa moglkwa i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Ye wakai kaima moglsre, dem muduo pe kaima sugwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">Ye okna ibo moglkwa, erme moglkwa, te okuo ime aimadi kamin morabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 6.3</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 4:8">di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Ana taragl 4-pela i ye God, aimadi kamun moglsre, sia king mina ame di moglkwa i kagie kade tedre, debie si, di wakai yei teigwa igne, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />bitno yagl 24-pela ikra God ye sia king mina ame di moglmara gumamugl yage kobragai padre, God ye kor aimadi moglkwa i kagie kade te, bitno gagl ama gugl edidre, pia si, sia king yomara gumamugl edidre, yegl digwa, <verse eid="REV 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />Yaglno Kade God motnga i, yoba mudu ene kagn kade tedre, debin si, ene swara yobugln pamiwe dinaiglkwa i, kuno erume digwa. I siragl pre enene wakai pitnara i mina ene taragl mudu ere yengo, taragl kane kane meglkwa ya paigwa. Ene swara taragl mudu ere yenga yagle motniwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Sipsip nagigle ye pepa ake pigla dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodidre, taragl ta ama kaniga i, yoba ta sia king mina ame di moglkwa ikra, ye pepa ta ogo wo mina ake moglko, kaniga. Pepa i, ake persre, kendel nuglo bage 7-pela si dagigwa. Te, pepa i mina akit akit ka beglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Ana na kan moglko, angelo gigledi ta moglkwa ka podo didre, yegl dugwa, Yoba ta kagie kade panan, ye pepa i idre, si dagimara i sada bogl ede, pepa i ake duglo sinabuka i, ira yegl erabe? dugwa. <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Ye yegl dugwa ba yoba swara ta heven ibo moglkwa mo makandigle moglkwa mo makan atne moglkwa i, pepa i ake duglo sidre, atne kanabuka i kuno ta erekrukwa.<verse eid="REV 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ana yoba ta pepa i ake duglo si, atne kanabedi dokigwa ba ta moglkrukwa pre na kai podo erika. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Kai podo ere moglko, bitno yagl 24-pela meglmara suna i, yagl swara ta na di narsre, Kai kodo dugwa. Kano! Devit gawamo i, ye Juda yugobunomo mina moglsre, laion mere yegl moglkwa ikra umiwe dugwa. Ye kudamo ikne mudu kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erukwa pre kendel nuglo bage 7-pela pepa mina si dagigwa i, ye sada bogl ede, pepa ake duglo sinabuka i, kuno erume dugwa.<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Ana yagl i yegl dugo, na kaniga i, taragl 4-pela sia king yomara magigl meglkwa ikra meglmara ya bitno yagl 24-pela meglmara agai suna i, sipsip nagigle ta adigl moglko, kaniga. Sipsip nagigle i, yoba ye okna si geglkwa mere yegl moglmedi kaniga. Te, ye bre yogagle 7-pela paugo, gumuglo ama 7-pela paugwa. Ye bre yogagle 7-pela i ya gumuglo 7-pela i, God Murubuglomo 7-pela, ye ede uglo koglo koglo enaiglmedi God dedugwa ikra, i nogugl edigwa. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Ana na sipsip nagigle i kanigo, ye pi yagl ta sia king mina ame di moglsre, pepa ta ogo wo mina akugwa ikra yugwa. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" /><figure style="fig" alt="Harp" file="bk00175b.tif" size="col" copy="Bass/Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="5.8" />Ye pepa ake yugo, taragl 4-pela meglkwa yeigo, bitno yagl 24-pela meglkwa i ama yeigo, ye gumamugl yage kobragai paigwa. Ye swara swarade taragl gita mere yegl ta yogwa i akidre, plet ta gol mina bekigwa ama ake meglkwa. Plet swara swarade i, ede nuglo ta gaiglko, demene wakai erukwa i atne moglkwa. Ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa i, God yobama kamage erikwa i, i nogugl edugwa.<verse eid="REV 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />Ana taragl 4-pela i ya yagl 24-pela i yage kobragai padre, giglage kor ta yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ene kagn kade paugwa pre ene pepa idre, kendel nuglo si dagimara ibo sada boratnga i, kuno erukwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Ene kagn kade yegl mere inga i, i siragl pre ene goglsre, bormainen mina yoba mere kide God yobama moraiglmedi topo singa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Yoba topo singa i, yoba uglo koglo koglo mogl, yugobuno pere pere moglsre,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">kantri pere pere meglko, kano ama pai pere pere edugwa i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">Yugobuno swara swarade meglmara ene yoba topo si ikne edinga.<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />Te, ene yoba i, i pi God yoba kingno mogl, suglno moglmara i suna edinga, meglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">Te, ene ama ye tawa teigwa yoba mere yegl God kogonmo eraiglmedi tengo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">Ye king moglsre, dumo makan sugl moraiglmiwe,</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:10">di, giglage yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ana na kan moglko, sia king ya taragl 4-pela ikra ya bitno yagl 24-pela meglmara angelo mere kide ere mogl, mogl winabo didre, ka podo digo, na prika. Angelo i, ye tausan ya milion mere kide kaima meglkwa pre na kerinaglka mere yegl moglkrikwa. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Ye digwa i, yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">Sipsip nagigle ta goglkwa i, kagie kade inabuka kuno erukwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">Ye yobuglomo podo paugo, taragl wakai wakai ye moglmara kau sugo, nomanemo ama podo kide paugwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">Nono ye di wakai yei tedre, kagie kade te, debie sinamga i, kuno erumiwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:12">di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ana angelo i ka yegl digo, God taragl kane kane ere yogwa meglkwa i, ama akie ka ta digo, prika. Taragl heven ibo meglkwa ya makandigle meglkwa ya makan atne meglkwa ya mudi nigl atne meglkwa i, ye mudu u swara pidre, yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">Yagl ta sia king mina ame di moglkwa i ya sipsip nagigle i,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">Ye kagno kade inabrika pamiwe digwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">Ye yobuglno podo kide paugo, aimadi kamin taragl mudu bitno mogl, suglno morabrika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">Nono ye debino sidre, kagno kade aimadi kamin tenamga pamiwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 5:13">di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Taragl mudu yegl digo, taragl 4-pela meglkwa ikra Kaima we! digo, Bitno yagl 24-pela ikra aglke kor yage kobragai padre, God ya sipsip nagigle i, kagno kade teigwa.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Sipsip nagigle ye kendel nuglo si dagimara sada bogl edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodidre, taragl swara ta ama kaniga i, pepa ta kendel nuglo bage 7-pela si dagigwa ikra sipsip nagigle akidre, bage swara ta sada bogl edugo, kaniga. Sada bogl edugo, taragl 4-pela meglkwa ikra, swarano ta ka podo kaima Ene ede wo! dugwa. Ye ka yegl dugwa i, kamin gur dumere yegl, ka podo yegl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Ana ye yegl dugo, na pi kaniga i, hos kruo ta moglko, te yagl ta hos i au si moglko, kaniga. Yagl i, God ye king morabedi king bitno gagl ta togo, edidre, kibr akidre, yoba kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo eragledi hos au sidre, ede ogo, na kaniga.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kandre, ta ama kaniga i, sipsip nagigle ere mogl, kendel nuglo si dage padiglkwa ikra bage 2 sada bogl edugo, na kaniga. Sada bogl edugo, taragl 4-pela meglmara suna i, ta namba 2 moglkwa i, Ene ede wo! dugwa. <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Yegl dugo, na pi kaniga i, yagl ta hos gogl ta au si ede ogo, kaniga. Yagl i, God bainet podo ta tedre, yoba makandigle meglkwa i ame wakai di mogl dinaiglmedi, ye kuda bogl, yene ikne ikne si goraiglmedi ero di yobuglo togo, ede ogwa.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kandre, ta ama kaniga i, sipsip nagigle i ere mogl, kendel nuglo si dage padiglkwa ikra bage 3 sada bogl edugo, na kaniga. Sada bogl edugo, taragl 4-pela meglmara suna i, ta namba 3 moglkwa i, Ene ede wo! dugwa. Dugo, na kaniga i, hos kama ta moglko, yagl ta hos kama i au sidre, kaya mokna skel ta ake moglko, na kaniga. <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />Na taragl i kan moglsre, taragl 4-pela meglmara suna i, yoba ta ka ta dugwa mere prika. Ye dugwa i, yagl ta hos au sugwa i, yegl di togwa, Kidan podo yenabedi etn, kugl wit ya bali mige podo borabuka. Yoba kogon ere ede ebi, min panan ye pidre, wit plet swara keme topo sinaiglkwa. Mo, bali inamnedi pribi, ye plet 3-pela keme topo sinaiglkwa. Ene kidan podo yegl yenabedi eratnga ba ene ede oliv ya ede wain ere kide erekitn, yoba oliv nuglo ya nigl wain ne pai moraiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />Na taragl yegl mere kandre, ta ama kaniga i, sipsip nagigle ikra kendel nuglo bage namba 4 sada bogl edugo, na kaniga. Sada bogl edugo, taragl 4-pela meglmara suna i, ta namba 4 moglkwa i, Ene ede wo! dugwa. <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Dugo, na pi kaniga i, yagl ta hos didugwa ta au sidre, ede ogo, na kaniga. Yagl i, kagie Geglkwa we digwa. Te, yagl i ede ogo, yagl ta ama ye moko mina ogwa. Yagl i kagie Geglkwa Dumo we digwa. God yagl suo i, wan u ikne ikne pidre, makandigle yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i tau mere kide kaima si gorabredi yobro togwa. Ye yoba mudu si bage 4-pela edidre, bage swara ta mudu si gorabrika mere yegl paugwa. Ye yoba si gorabrika i, tau bainet mina si goglsre, tau kidan mina ama si goglsre, kide mina ya agl bugla are drano mina pra, ye yoba mere kide si gorabredi yobro togo, ye ede ebrika.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Ana sipsip nagigle ikra kendel nuglo bage namba 5 sada bogl edugo, na kaniga igne, tawa bogl ta heven ibo yogo, tawa bogl i mabunomugl yoba kiano tau meglko, kaniga. Yoba i, okna God kamo pre mediglsre, yoba God kamo di te meglkwa pre yoba ye si geglko, ye kiano erme tawa bogl mabunomugl meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />Ye moglsre, ka podo di, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade yo, ene den mudn pe kaima sugo, ka kaima keme dinga motnga. Makandigle yoba no si geglkwa i, ene aunake ye ka tage tedre, ye erimara ere te ikne edinatne? digwa. <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Yegl digo, God ye swara swarade gagl suna kruo olto ta tedre, ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kuri ta mogl ir si prio! Pribi, ene agroma na kogona ere meglkwa ime, ene si geglmere mere yegl tau ama si goraiglkwa. Ye si goraiglkwa pai moglkwa i, si geglbidre, okuo na ye ere sinaluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Ana na kan moglko, sipsip nagigle ikra kendel nuglo bage namba 6 ama sada bogl edugwa. Sada bogl edugo, imem podo kide ta makandigle ugo, ade abuglage sikre, ake mim eruko, ba ake gogl ere, ede u bormai mere yegl ogwa. <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />Yegl eruko, te, ir magugo, ede fik mogomo bogl yeikre, yage simere yegl, kugl kuri kamin mitna ibo paigwa i, yage makandigle sigwa. <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />Kugl kuri yage sigo, te yoba pepa ake pere i suna edimere mere yegl, kamun mitna ibo yegl pere ede pi yene imin daglko, ailan ya muglo meglbi makandigle paigwa i, mudu pra pra piga kar di, suglki wuglki erikwa.<verse eid="REV 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Ana taragl yegl mere makandigle plau dugo, yoba mudu ede pi muglo meglbi kobuglo paimara ya kobuglo mur atne pidre, teke paigwa. Yoba king meglkwa ya yoba kade meglkwa ya ami sugl meglkwa yoba ya yoba mige moni podo kan neigwa ya yobuglno podo paugwa i mudu teke paigo, te, yoba yoko meglkwa ya yoba tau ye yoba pere boino pai teigwa i pra, mudu teke paigwa. <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />Teke pai, muglo meglbi ya kobuglo yegl di teigwa, Yagl ta sia king mina ame di moglkwa i ya sipsip nagigle dem kubrukwa i, no kan dinabriwa. Ene yage, si kegl di, no teke padilo! digwa. <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />I siragl pre ye suo i, deno kubrisre, ka tage norabrika ege kade i, u kodugwa pre yoba swara ta adigl morabuka i kuno ta erekrumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">God ye Israel yoba 144,000 muno gane ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodidre, ta ama kaniga i, dumo makan yei pi, uglo yogwa i, bage 4-pela yogwa. Yomara i, angelo 4-pela adigl moglsre, ir ede suna u dinabedi ake kegl di meglko, kaniga. Ir ta ade umara mo ade beimara mo nigl bre beye mogl udre, dumo makan mo mudi nigl mo ede swara ta ir si dinabedi ake kegl digwa. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="REV 7:2-3" />Ana angelo 4-pela i, God ye dumo makan ya mudi nigl ere kide ere tenaiglmedi yobuglo togwa ba angelo pere ta ama ade umara ede egli udre, ka podo di, angelo 4-pela i yegl di togwa, Ene kan molo! No God niglmo kogonmo yoba meglkwa i, mabro mina muno gane ere padigl te kodumdre, ene dumo makan, mudi nigl, ya ede pra, okuo ere kide eraiglmiwe dugwa. Te, angelo i, taragl ta ake moglkwa i, God kor aimadi moglkwa i, ye yobama muno ganemo ere tenabuka taragl i, ake moglkwa.<verse eid="REV 7:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ana angelo i yegl dugo, ye angelo tau bogl yoba muno gane ere padigl teigo, na yoba siramna mere muno gane igwa i, digo, prika. Ye digwa i, yoba 144,000 muno gane ime digwa. Yoba 144,000 muno gane igwa i, ye Israel yoba yugobunono swara swarade mina meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />Juda yoba yugobunono i mina 12,000 meglko, te, Ruben yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Gat yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 ama meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />Te, Aser yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Naptali yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Manase yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />Yegl meglko, te, Simeon yoba yuguobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Livai yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Isakar yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 ama meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />Te, Sebulun yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Josep yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 meglko, Benjamin yoba yugobunono mina 12,000 ama meglkwa. Israel yoba yegl mere, yugobuno 12-pela meglkwa i, i swara ede, 144,000 muno gane igwa.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodidre, ta ama kaniga i, sia king yomara ya sipsip nagigle moglmara gumanomugl i, yoba mere kide kaima, yoba ta keribi, kuno erekrabuka mere yegl meglko, na kaniga. Kantri swara swarade ya yugubono swara swarade ya te, tok ples swara swarade paugwa i, yoba tau ede u yoba mere kide meglmara suna i, meglkwa. Ye kugugl gagl kruo edidre, ede pam tri yaudo ake mogl, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />ka podo yegl digwa, Nono Godno, sia king mina ame di moglkwa i ya te, sipsip nagigle i, ye suo i keme no ere ibriwe digwa.<verse eid="REV 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />Ana yoba mere kide kaima i yegl digo, sia king yomara i, taragl 4-pela i ya bitno yagl 24-pela i ama meglko, angelo mudu bina mogl winabo digwa. Angelo i mudu kan sia king yomara edidre, yage kobragai pai, God kagie kade teigwa. <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />Ye God kagie kade tedre, yegl digwa, Ka kaima, nono Godno aimadi kamin kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Ye swara nomanemo podo paugo, yobuglomo ama podo kide paugwa. Nono aimadi kamin ye di wakai yei tedre, debie si, kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Kaima we di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Ana angelo i yegl di kodigo, bitno yagl 24-pela meglmara suna ikra swara ta na kira pogl prisre, yegl dugwa, Yoba kugugl gagl kruo edigwa meglkwa i, ye yoba ira moglsre, aglo mogl, wimedi pitne? dugwa. <verse eid="REV 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Yegl dugo, na di ikne ede te, Yagl kade yo, na ta pre kan erekrika ba ene pre kan etnedi prie diga. Na yegl digo, ye ere mogl, yegl di narukwa, Yoba i, ye ege kide, yubun podo kide ta erme plau dugwa igne i suna mogl, ede meda wigwa yobamo meglmiwe dugwa. Ye kugugl gagl kruo edigwa i, sipsip nagigle bormaimo mina kuguglno gaglno nigl edidre, ere i kruo edigwa. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Yegl pre ye God siamo king yomara magigl moglsre, etne ya eduer ye yugumo yomara magigl i yugugl mogl, ye kogonmo ere teigwa. God, ye sia king mina ame di moglkwa i, ye sel yugumo ye meglmara tebe i, kei padran, <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />ye ege swara ta kidan goglsre, nigl goglsre, erekraiglkwa. Te, ye ama ade dekre, niga dikrabuka. <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />I siragl pre sipsip nagigle ye suna, sia king yomara moglkwa i, yoba sipsip suglno meglmere yegl mere, ye suglno morabuka. Ye suglno moglsre, ama ye nigl ta nedre, kor aimadi moraiglkwa i, ogo beimara obuno di tenan, nenaiglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 49.10</char></note> Te, God yoba i kai erekraiglmedi erabuka. Kai ta eribi, God yene kai nuglo koko ede tenabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 25.8</char></note> di, yagl i yegl di narukwa.<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">Sipsip nagigle ye kendel nuglo si dagimara bage namba 7 sada bogl edugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Ana sipsip nagigle ye pepa ta kendel nuglo si dagigwa ikra bage namba 7 sada bogl edugo, na kaniga. Sada bogl edugwa igne, yoba ya angelo ki heven ibo meglkwa i hap aua mere yegl, ka dikre, krede kaima meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Yegl eriko, na kan moglko, angelo 7-pela ye God gumamugl adigl meglkwa i, God ye swara swarade biugel ta togo, igwa.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Ana ta ama kaniga i, plet ta gol mina bekigwa angelo pere ta ake idre, u aduglko, na kaniga. Te, God siamo king yomara gumamugl i, bogl ta gol mina beke edigwa yogwa. Bogl i, ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa i garamnedi beke edigwa yogo, angelo ta ugwa i u bogl yomara magigl adigl moglko, angelo ta ere mogl, ye ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa i, tau mere garabedi togwa. Ye taragl i garabuka i, God yobama kamage erikwa i idre, i suna suna ede, garabuka mere yegl paugwa. Ana yegl paugo, angelo i ye ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa i, tau bogl mina gaglsre, <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />tau plet ake moglkwa i mina gaglko, ede inge i, God yobama kamage erikwa i bogl, God gumuglo mina ede egli ogwa. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Ede inge ede egli ogo, doga ta bogl mina dogwa i, angelo i tau idre, plet gol mina i atne ede, pia si makandigle edugwa. Pia si makandigle edugo, kamun tai sidre, kamun gur podo dugo, mu kane kane dugo, imem ama ta ugwa.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angelo 4-pela ye biugelno pu digwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Trumpet" file="HK062E.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="8.6" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugo, angelo 7-pela ye biugel ake meglkwa i ere mogl, biugel pu dinamnedi erikwa.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Angelo swara ta ere mogl, biugel namba 1 pu dugo, be dugwa igne, aragl mogo, doga drabie ya bormai bogl akie yage makandigle sigwa. Sigo, dumo makan ya ede paigwa i bage swarade mere de kodugo, bage suo mere yoko yogwa. Te, kugl makandigle paugwa i, mudu kaima de tege ere kodugwa.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ana angelo namba 2 ye biugel pu dugwa igne, taragl ta muglo meglbi mere yegl padre, doga de pai moglko, yage mudi nigl suna sugwa. Sugo, mudi nigl tau u bormai ogo, tau yoko moglkwa. Mudi nigl u bormai ogwa i, bage swara mere u bormai ogo, bage suo mere yoko moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />Yegl eruko, mudi nigl atne taragl ta kor meglkwa mudu i, ama mere kide geglkwa. Taragl kane kane mudi nigl meglkwa i, bage swara mere mudu geglko, bage suo mere yoko mogl pai meglkwa. Te, sip ta nigl yaudomugl wan meglkwa i ama, ikne mudu kide eriko, ikne yoko yogwa. Bage swara ta mere yegl kide eriko, bage suo mere yoko yogwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="REV 8:10-11" />Ana angelo namba 3 ye biugel pu dugwa igne, kugl kuri podo ta ken mere yegl de paugwa i, kamin mitna ibo pai, yage si, nigl umara ya ogo beimara tau mere ere kide erukwa. Bage swara mere ere kide eruko, bage suo mere yoko meglkwa. Kugl kuri i, kagie Giu Erukwa we digwa. Nigl bage bage ere kide erukwa i, giu eruko, yoba mere kide nedre, geglkwa.<verse eid="REV 8:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ana angelo namba 4 ye biugel pu dugwa igne, God ye ade ba ya kugl kuri abuglage wakai si dinaiglmedi ere kide ere togwa. Ere togo, kugl kuri ikne, bage swara mere yegl abuglage sikriko, ikne, bage suo mere yegl, abuglage si pai meglkwa. Te, ade sugwa i, ege swara swarade ere i suota edugo, swara ta ade abuglage sikruko, bage suo keme abuglage sugwa mere yegl paugwa. Ba paugwa i, ama yegl erukwa. Eduer ege swara swarade ere i suota edugo, swara ta ba dekruko, suo keme ba dogo, na kaniga.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kandre, taragl ta ama kaniga i, kua kigla ta kamun mitna ibo pur di wogo, kaniga. Kua i pur didre, ama ka podo yegl dugwa, Yoba makandigle meglkwa i, yubun podo kide suota ye meglmara plau dinabuka pai moglmiwe dugwa. Angelo suota ye biugelno pu dinamnedi ere meglkwa i, ye pu dibi, taragl kide i plau dinabiwe di, yegl dugo, na prika.<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="s">Angelo namba 5 ye biugelmo pu dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ana angelo namba 5 ye biugelmo pu dugo, biugelmo be dugwa igne, angelo ta okna kugl kuri mere yegl heven ibo pai, yage atne makandigle sugwa i, kaniga. Ana angelo i moglko, God ere mogl, ye ki ta togwa. Ki i, makan mur ta yei ede atne ime ogwa i, yaurnabuka pre togwa. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Ana angelo i, ye ki idre, makan mur ikra yauro edugo, ede inge podo ede egli ugwa. Ede inge i, yugu dogwa inge erumere mere yegl, inge podo kide ede egli u kamun mitna ya ade sugwa i pra, si kegl dugo, mim erukwa. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Ana ede inge podo erumara suna i, taragl tau mogode mere yegl meglkwa, ede inge bogl akie ede egli udre, yage makandigle si, ake wai digo, na kaniga. Taragl i, God ye toki kide yoba simere mere yegl ye yoba giugl kaiglbi, giugl praiglmedi yobuglo togwa. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />God ye yobuglo yegl tedre, ama ye di te, yegl dugwa, Ene kugl kan makandigle paigwa mo ede swara ta ere kide erekrio. Yoba ta na muno gane mabro mina padigl tekrika i keme ene ere kide ere tenaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Ene yoba ta si goglkraiglkwa ba ene ba 5-pela mere yoba giugl kagl wan meglbi, yoba giugl podo praiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Toki kide ta yoba giugl kaiglko, ye giugl primere mere yegl, taragl mogode mere yegl meglkwa i yoba giugl kaiglbi, ye giugl yegl mere praiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Igne i, yoba giugl podo yegl prisre, goramnba di pre, goraiglkwa konbo dokinaiglkwa ba ye goraiglkwa i, kuno ta erekrabuka. Ye kor mogl, giugl pre moraiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Ana taragl mogode mere yegl weigo, kaniga i, ye hos ta ede kuda wagle enamnedi weimere mere yegl weigo, na kaniga. Taragl i bitno mina, king bitno gagl gol mina bekigwa mere yegl ta edigwa. Te, ye gumano drano yoba gumano drano kunere yegl keglkwa. <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />Te, ye bitno yugo abu bitno yugo olto sumere mere yegl olto sugo, ye signo laion signo keglmere yegl keglkwa. <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />Ye pitno mina taragl ta paugwa i, soldia ain pitno mina padiglmere yegl paugwa. Te, ye koyeno tama si, pur digwa igne, kwige sugwa. Hos mere kide muku di, karis gudu idre, ede kuda wagle eigo, kwige sumere mere yegl kwige sugwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Horses and chariot" file="hk00191b.tif" size="span" loc="9.9" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="9.9" /> <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Taragl mogode mere yegl meglkwa i, ye deno yagle i, toki kide skopion deno yagle keglmere mere yegl keglko, God ye ba 5-pela mere wan mogl, yoba sinaiglmedi yobuglo togwa i, ye deno yagle mina yoba sinaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Te, taragl mogode mere meglkwa i, ye kingno ta moglkwa. Kingno i, angelo kide ta mur mina atne ime mogl, ede meda ugwa ikra, moglkwa. Ye kagie ka Hibru mina Abadon we digo, ka Grik mina Apolion we dumga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kagie suo i, Abadon ya Apolion suo akie mem swara paugwa, mem i, Taragl ere kide erukwa yagl.</char></note><verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Ana yubun podo suota unaiglkwa paugwa i, swara ta yegl mere udre, dudugo, na kaniga ba suo ama unabrika pai moglkwa.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angelo namba 6 ye biugelmo pu dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Ana angelo namba 6 ye biugelmo pu dugo, be dugwa igne, yoba ka ta dugo, na prika. Yoba ta ka dugwa prika i, God gumamugl ede nuglo demene wakai erukwa garamnedi bogl ta gol mina kugl yeimara ikra, kau bre yogagle bogl puduno 4-pela pamara i, yoba ta magigl moglsre, ka dugwa. <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="REV 9:14-15" />Ye ka ta dugwa i, angelo namba 6 biugel ake moglkwa ikra di te, yegl dugwa, Ene pi angelo kide 4-pela ye nigl Yufretis womara kane pai meglkwa i, i meda edo dugwa. Ene ye i meda edin, ye yoba mudu makandigle meglkwa i, si buno di bage suota edidre, bage swara ta si gogl kodinaiglmiwe di, yegl dugwa. Angelo 4-pela kide i, God ye dumo i si kane sugo, ye kanana sugl mogl, bugla yugu, ba, ege, aua God padigl tomere i plau dinan, ye ede meda pi yoba ere kide ere tenaiglkwa. Ana angelo ta biugel ake moglkwa i, ye i meda edugo, <verse eid="REV 9:14-15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />angelo kide ye ami tau bogl yoba sinamnedi i makai sigwa. Ami i, soldia hos au sigwa i, 200 milion mere yegl meglmiwe di, yoba yegl digo, na prika.<verse eid="REV 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-18" style="v" sid="REV 9:17-18" />Ana taragl yegl mere na gumuglnamugl eruko, kan kodidre, ta ama kaniga i, ami hos au sigwa ikra ye hosno bogl ama meglko, kaniga. Ami meglkwa i, ain gogl ya morodugwa ya didugwa pitno mina padiglkwa. Te, hos i, ye bitno laion bitno keglmere mere yegl keglko, ye drano mina doga bauglo ya ede inge ya kobuglo de paugwa i, ede meda wigwa. Taragl yegl mere ye drano mina ede meda u, yubun suota i nogugl edidre, yoba mere kide si geglkwa. Yoba makandigle meglkwa i, si buno di bage suota edidre, bage swara ta mudu si geglkwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="REV 9:17-18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Hos i, ye drano mina ya deno yagle mina ama yoba sibi, kuno erabuka. I siragl pre ye deno yagle i, toki mere yegl paugo, deno yagle puduno ime, toki bitno mere yegl paugo, deno yagle i mina ye yoba ere sidre, giugl teigwa.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="REV 9:20-21" />Ana yubun yegl mere plau didre, dudugo, yoba makandigle kor mogl pai meglkwa i, ye nomano yake tekre, murubuglo kide ya taragl kwiano, yoba ye ogono mina bekigwa i kagno kade te pai meglkwa. Ye taragl gol ya silva ya bras mina bekidre, ede kobuglo mina bekigwa i, gumuglno mina taragl swara ta kankre, kinano mina taragl swara ta prikre, konbauna ama wan kankrikwa ba yoba taragl i kagno kade te pai moglsre, ama yoba pere si gogl pai meglkwa. Ye taragl yegl mere ere pai moglsre, kumugl abai ya yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nedre, kumo giai ersre, yoba pere taraglno kunogl neigwa i, kide kodo, nomano yake tekre, ere pai meglkwa.<verse eid="REV 9:20-21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Angelo buk kebra ta ake moglsre, Jon togo, nogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodidre, ama ta kaniga i, angelo gigledi kaima ta ama moglkwa i, heven ibo mogl, ede atne ugo, na kaniga. Angelo i, ye kamun kua kruo were moglko, te ye bre mina titokubun tebe boglkwa. Te, ye guma dra ade abuglage sumere mere yegl abuglage sugo, ye kagle koglo koglo i, doga drabie ede mitna ugwa mere yegl kaniga. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Te, angelo i ye ogo mina buk kebra ta pogl, ake moglkwa. Angelo i ye kagle wo kra mudi nigl egrisre, te kagle koda kra dumo makan egrukwa. <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />Ye yegl mere adigl moglsre, laion be podo dumere mere yegl ka podo dugo, kamun ege 7-pela gur dugwa. Gru dugwa i,yoba mere yegl dugo, na prika. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Ana kamun gur didre, ka siragl mere dugwa ibo, na bogl atne edenagledi erika ba yoba ta heven ibo mogl, ka ta yegl di narukwa, Kamun ege 7-pela gur didre, ka siragl mere dugwa i, ene pre i nomanen suna keme ede, bogl atne edekro! di, yegl di naruko, na bogl atne edekrika.<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Ana angelo ta mudi nigl ya dumo makan egruko, na kaniga ikra, ye ere mogl, ogo wo ake mitna ede, heven ibo buglo sidre, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="REV 10:6-7" />God kagie mina ka gigledi yegl dugwa, God ye sugl kanana moglkwa i, dudumiwa. Angelo namba 7 ye kuri ta mogl, biugelmo pu dinan, God ye siragl mere eragledi prukwa i, kaima plau dinabe dugwa. God ye eragledi prukwa i, okna ye niglmo kogonmo yoba tau ye kamo kep yoba ta meglkwa i keme di togwa ba biugel i boran, God siragl mere eragledi prukwa i, plau di, ede u nogugl pi kodinabiwe di, yegl dugwa. Ye God kagie mina yegl dume diga i, God kor aimadi moglsre, kamun mitna ya dumo makan ya mudi nigl ere yogwa yaglmo moglkwa i kagie mina dugwa pre diga. Te, ye taragl kane kane kamun mitna ya dumo makan mina ya mudi nigl atne meglkwa ya paigwa i, ye ere yogwa yagl moglkwa i, kagie mina dugwa pre diga.<verse eid="REV 10:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugo, yoba ta okna heven ibo ka ta dugo, na prika i, aglke kor na di narsre, yegl dugwa, Angelo ta mudi nigl ya dumo makan egre moglkwa ime, ye buk kebra ta pogl, ake moglkwa i, ene pi yo! dugwa. <verse eid="REV 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Yegl dugwa pre na angelo i moglmara pidre, Buk kebra i, naro diga. Na yegl digo, angelo i di ikne ede narsre, yegl dugwa, Ene buk i, idre, no! dugwa. Ene nen, dran mina brume nuglo druo erumere yegl erabuka ba den biglko mina giu erabiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esekiel 3.3</char></note> di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Yegl dugo, na buk kebra i idre, neiga. Na neiga igne, kaima drana mina brume nuglo mere yegl druo erukwa ba na ne atne edigo, dena biglko mina giu erukwa.<verse eid="REV 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Ana na neigo, yoba ta di nariko, prika i, Ene God kamo aglke kor kep ere, bogl atne edin, yoba kantri pere pere ya yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i ya, ka pere pere digwa i ya te, ye kingno meglkwa i, i mudu pre ka kep ere dinatniwe, di, yegl di narikwa.<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Yagl suo ye God kamo yoba di tebrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Ana angelo ta ere mogl, buglo sie ta muglbo mere yegl yogwa i narsre, yegl dugwa, Ene ede pi God yugumo sie yedre, tawa bogl ta kiglkwa i ama sie yei, yoba siramna ta ye God yugumo yomara togl suna mogl, God debie si meglkwa i, ama kerenatne dugwa. <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />Ba agai ta togl meda yogwa i, ene sie yeikro. God ye dumo i, yoba ta Juda yoba moglkrikwa i togwa pre sie ta yeikratniwe dugwa. Yoba ye yugobuno pere mogl, Juda yoba moglkrikwa i, ye God taunmo kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo ere, ba 42-pela mere ege 1,260 de yegl God taunmo i, sugl moraiglme dugwa.<verse eid="REV 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Sugl meglbi, yagl suo na kana yoba di nogugl ede tenabredi yobuglo bogl tenagliwa. Na yobuglo bogl tebo, yagl suo i ye deno muduno ibun dogwa pre kugugl gagl kide edidre, ba 42-pela ege 1,260 de mere yegl na kana kep ere dinabriwe di, Krais yegl dume di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Ana yagl suo i, ye Yagl Kade, dumo makan mudu sugl moglkwa yagl i gumuglo mina ede oliv suo ya ken lam suo mere yegl miurka. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Yoba ta ye ere kide ere tenamnedi eribi, ye drano mina doga drabie ede meda pi yoba i si gorabuka. Yegl pre yoba ta ye ere kide ere tenamnedi eraiglkwa i, mudu doga de, goraiglkwa paugwa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Te, yagl suo i, God ye kimagl kane kane erabredi yobuglo tenabuka pre ye ka kep ere di morabrika igne i kamun sikrabedi eribr, kamun sikrabuka. Te, nigl ama ede u bormai koglo enabedi ersre, yubun kane kane dumo makan mina plau dinabedi erabrika i, kuno erabuka pre ye kimagl kane kane yegl ta erabugledi prabrika igne, erabrika keme paugwa.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Ana yagl suo i ye Krais kamo yoba di te kodibr, agl bugla are ta mur yei ede atne kaima omara i mogl, ede meda ugwa ikra ere mogl yagl suo i, kuda bogl tedre, ye yobuglo ere te, ye si gorabuka. <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />Si goran, ye ogono nagino, taun ta yoba okna ye Yaglno Kade Jisas si geglmara i, konbauna suna yenabuka. Taun i kagie, ka ebrie mere yegl, dumo Sodom mo Isip we dinamga. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Ana yagl suo i, ogono nagino ege suota yedre, ege namba 4 ikne keme meda yegl yenan, yoba uglo koglo koglo moglsre, yugobuno pere pere mogl, ka pere pere digwa i, ye ogono nagino toro kan moglsre, yoba ye maugl si dinaiglmedi mane dinaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Te, yagl suo i giurka pre makandigle yoba wakai prisre, gun yei, ye gun yeigwa pre taragl wakai te ikne ikne edenaiglkwa. I siragl pre yagl suo i komono kana kide kane kane makandigle yoba meglkwa i, sinabedi eribr, ye giugl praiglkwa pre okuo yagl suo i giur, yoba i gun yenaiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Ana yagl suo i, ogono nagino ege suota mudu meda yedre, ege swara ta ikne keme meda yegl yenan, God ere mogl, ye pipo didre, kor morabredi eran, ye yene adrabrika. Adiur, yoba ye kan moraiglkwa i, kudugl podo goraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Te, yagl suo i adiur, God heven ibo mogl, di atne ede, Ene ede egli wiro! dinan, ye kudano ikne kan meglbi, yagl suo i ye God ka dinabuka i prisre, ede egli ibo pi, kamun kua mina suna pidre, ede heven ibo enabrika.<verse eid="REV 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ana yagl suo i adiglsre, ede heven ibo enabrika igne i imem podo kide ta udre, taun kade suna yomara i, yugu togl bage bage yenaiglmara i, bage swara mere ere kide ersre, bage 9-pela mere kanige erabuka. Yegl plau dinan, yoba 7,000 goraiglkwa. Geglbi, yoba ta kor moraiglkwa i kudugl goglsre, God ye heven ibo moglkwa i kagie kade tenaiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Ana yubun podo suota plau dinaiglkwa paugwa i, yubun namba 2 yegl mere udre, dudugo, na kaniga ba yubun swara ta ama tabre plau dinabuka pai moglkwa.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Angelo namba 7 ye biugelmo pu dugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Ana okuo, angelo namba 7 i, ye biugelmo pu dugo, be dugwa igne, angelo heven ibo meglkwa i ka podo yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">Nono Yaglno Kade i ya te, ye Kere Yugwa Yagl i, ye king moglsre, dumo makan mudu bitno mogl kodibrika.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:15">Te, God ye aimadi kamin king morabiwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 11:15">di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Ana angelo yegl di kodigo, bitno yagl 24-pela ye siano king mina ame di mogl, God gumuglo mina meglkwa i, yage kobragai padre, God kagie kade te, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">Yagl Kade God yo, yobugln pai kawa togwa motnga i, no ene di wakai yei tomga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">Ene motnga i, ene okna aimadi kamin moglsre, erme ama mogl pai motnga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">No ene di wakai yei tomga i, i siragl pre ene yobugln podo pamara i mina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">ene taragl mudu i atne ede kodidre, erme yoba mudu bitno motnga.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, ye ene deno kubro teigwa ba ene ye kubro tenga i, erme i nogugl edinga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Erme ene yoba geglkwa i, kotno pratnga ege yogwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">Ene ye kotno prisre, ama nigl kogonen yoba ka kep erikwa i ya te, ene yobanma mudu topo wakai tenatnga.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">Te, yoba kade meglkwa mo kebra meglkwa mo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">ene kuduglnen geglkwa i, ene topo wakai tedre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">ama makadigle u kide enabedi erikwa mabuno meglkwa i, ene ere kide ere te kodinatniwe</para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 11:18">di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Ana igne i God yugumo heven ibo yogwa i yauro edigo, na kaniga i, God ka di te paduglkwa boksmo ikra yugugl yogo, na kaniga. Kanigo, kamun tai sidre, kamun gur podo di pai moglko, imem ta makandigle ugo, te, aragl mogo podo kaima yage makandigle sugwa.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Jon abu ya toki podo kide ta kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Ana okuo, na kan moglko, diu podo to kamun mitna ibo plau dugwa. Diu i yegl mere paugwa, abu ta kamun mitna ibo moglko, na kaniga. Abu i, ye ba mina tebe adigl moglkwa. Ye kuguglmo gaglmo ade abuglage sumere mere yegl sugwa. Te, king bitno gagl edimere mere yegl, kugl kuri 12-pela ye bre gagl mere yegl edugwa. <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />Ana abu i, dane paugo, ye gak kuragledi gagie giugl pre, grigle dugwa.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Ana na diu yegl mere kandre, ama diu ta yegl mere kaniga, toki gogl podo kide ta kamun mitna ibo plau dugo, na kaniga. Toki i bre 7-pela koglkwa. Bre 7-pela paimara i, bre yogagle 10-pela ugwa. Te, bre swara swarade pamara i, king bitno gagl edugo, paugwa. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Ana toki i, dem yagle mina kugl kuri tau mere kide brum di edugo, yage makandigle sigwa. Kugl kuri kamin mitna ibo paigwa i, bage suota mere yegl paigo, bage swara mere yegl, toki mudu si atne edugo, bage suo mere, ibo pai meglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 12:4">Ana toki podo i, ye abu ta gak kuragledi erukwa ikra gumamugl moglsre, gak ta kuran, si nenagledi sugl kan moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Ye sugl kan moglko, abu i ye yagl gak ta kuglkwa. Yagl gak ta kuglkwa i, ye buglo muglbo ain mina ta bekigwa i ake idre, yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i mudu bitno mogl, suglno morabuka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.9</char></note> moglkwa. Abu i, yagl gak i kuglko, God ye yagl gak i tabre ake i mina edidre, ye siamo king mina morabedi edugo, moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Moglko, abu i teke ede pi dumo ta wau yomara ogwa. Dumo wau yomara suna i, God ye dumo ta ere wakai ersre, ye ege 1,260 de agai i moran, angelo ye suglmo moglsre, kaya mokna i pi tebi, ne morabedi dumo i ere wakai eruko, ye teke ede dumo i ogwa.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Ana igne i heven ibo kuda podo beglkwa. Angelo ta kagie Maikel we digwa i yogo, ye angelo tau sugl moglkwa i yeigo, ye kuda bogl, toki podo ikra angeloma bogl teigo, toki podo ya angelo tau ye duglo beglkwa i ama kuda bogl ikne ede teigwa <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />ba ye yobuglno pai kuno erekrukwa pre ye okuo heven ibo mogl dinaiglmedi <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />God ye toki podo i ya te, angelo tau ye duglo beglkwa i, pia si makandigle edugwa. Toki podo i, ye toki ta okna ibo moglkwa ikra moglsre, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i bakagl togwa yagle moglko, ye kagie Satan we didre, Yagl Kide we dumga.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kanigo, yoba ta heven ibo moglkwa i ka podo ta dugo, na prika. Ye ka dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Erme nono Godno i, ye nono ere i kodugo, yobuglomo ede nogugl umiwe dugwa. Te, ye erme nono kingno mogl kodugwa. Te, ye Kere Yugwa Yagl moglkwa i, ama yoba mudu bitno moragledi namba i kodugwa. I siragl pre God ye Satan pia si makandigle edugwa. Satan, ye nono agroma abaroma aglauno etne ya eduer God gumamugl di pogl moglkwa i, erme God ye pia si makandigle ede kodume dugwa. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Te, nono agroma abaroma meglkwa i, ye sipsip nagigle bormaimo suru edumara i mina yobuglo idre, ye kamo yoba di nogugl ede te meglkwa. Te, ye yene kor moraiglkwa i, pre i mitna edekre, sipsip nagigle pre goraiglkwa ama pra we digwa pre ye Yagl Kide yobuglo ere teimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Ana taragl yegl mere plau dugwa pre ene angelo ya yoba mudu heven ibo meglkwa i, gun yeio! dugwa. Ba ene yoba ta makandigle wan meglkwa mo mudi nigl tebe wan meglkwa i, yubun podo kide inaiglkwa. I siragl pre Yagl Kide ede atne u ene meglmara moglsre, dem podo kubrukwa. I siragl pre ye prukwa i, ege sugunagle keme mogl pai moraglka pamiwe di pre, kide prumiwe di, yoba ta heven ibo moglkwa i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ana toki podo ikra, God na pia si makandigle ede kodumiwedi pre kan ersre, abu ta yagl gak kuglkwa i sinagledi sika sugwa. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Ye sika sugwa ba God ye kua kigla koye suo abu i padigl togo, ye pur di ede pi dumo wau yomara ta teke panabedi God ere yei tomara i ede ogwa. Ye pidre, bugla yugu suota mudu moglsre, bugla yugu ta ikne dumo i toki podo na kan dinabedi teke paugo, angelo tau ye suglmo moglsre, kaya mokna teigwa. <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Abu teke ede ogwa igne, toki podo ikra abu i nigl nedre, gorabedi pre ye dra mina nigl we di i meda edugo, nigl podo i, abu teke ede omara sika sugwa. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Sika sugwa ba dumo makan ere mogl, abu i ake ple di tedre, makan buko di ede koglo koglo ogo, toki nigl we di i meda edugwa ikra, ede makan atne ogwa pre abu i si goglkrukwa. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Yegl erukwa pre toki podo i, ye abu i dem podo kubro tedre, ede pi ye gagiglma tau, God kamo duglo boglsre, Jisas kamo yoba di te meglkwa i sinagledi ede ogwa.<verse eid="REV 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Ana okuo, toki podo i ere mogl, mudi nigl bina adigl moglko, na kaniga.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Agl bugla are suo plau dibrika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Ana okuo, na kaniga i, agl bugla are ta mudi nigl ede meda ugo, na kaniga. Agl bugla are i, bre 7-pela koglsre, te, bre yogagle 10-pela ama ugwa. Bre yogagle 10-pela i mina, king bitno gagl 10-pela edugwa. Te, ye bre 7-pela i mina, kagie swara swarade bogl atne edigo, paugwa. Ye kagie swara swarade i, ka kide, God di kide yei teigwa paugwa. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Agl bugla are i, ye pusi are podo kide, lepat we digwa i moglmere moglkwa ba ye ogo kagle bea ogono kaglno keglmere mere yegl koglko, te ye dra, laion drano keglmere mere koglkwa. Ye yegl mere moglko, toki podo ikra na agl bugla are i sia kingna mina ame di mogl, yoba mere kide bitno morabedi yobuglna teiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Ana na yegl kandre, ama kaniga i, agl bugla are i, bre 7-pela paimara suna i swara ta yoba sigo, podo boglkwa pre ye gorabuka paugwa ba ye goglkrukwa. Yoba ye bre mina sigo, boglmara i, kor yogo, ye ede u kor ogwa. Ede u kor ogo, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i nagino koglsre, agl bugla are i, kamo duglo bogl meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Ye kamo duglo boglsre, te toki podo ye yobuglomo agl bugla are togwa ikra pre yoba toki i kagie kade teigwa. Tedre, agl bugla are i ama kagie kade te, yegl digwa, Yoba swara ta mogl mitna ede, agl bugla are i ta tekrime digwa. Te, yoba swara kaima ta ye kuda bogl tenabuka ama kuno ta erekrumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Ana God ye agl bugla are i ka kide kane kane di narsre, ba 42-pela yene prumere erabedi kanige eruko, <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />ye God di kide yei tedre, kagie ere kide ere togwa. Ye God kagie ere kide ere tedre, te, God sel yugumo heven ibo yogwa i di kide yei tedre, yoba heven ibo meglkwa i ama di kide yei togwa. <verse eid="REV 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Te, God ama agl bugla are i na yobanama kuda bogl tedre, yobuglo erabedi kanige ersre, ye yoba uglo koglo koglo mogl, yugobuno pere pere moglsre, ka pere pere digwa i mudu bitno morabedi ama togwa. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Bitno morabedi togo, makandigle yoba tau kagno kor aimadi moraiglkwa buk i mina paikrukwa meglkwa i, ye agl bugla are i kagie kade teigwa. Kor aimadi moraiglkwa buk i, sipsip nagigle, yoba ye okna si geglkwa ikra, bukmo yogwa. Buk i God okna ibo, dumo makan ere yeikrukwa igne, yoba ta kor aimadi moraiglkwa i, kagno bogl atne ede kodugwa.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Ana ka magigl paugwa i, yoba ta pre pogl sinagledi pran, ye wakai ere kina gudu prabuka paugwa. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />God yoba ta ede kane yugu enabedi di paduglkwa i, kaima ede kane yugu enabuka. Te, yoba ta, bainet mina si goraiglmedi di paduglkwa i, ye kaima si goraiglkwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 15.2</char></note> Taragl yegl plau dinabuka pre God yobama ta moraiglkwa i pre medigl pai moglsre, adigl gigledi moraiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Ana okuo agl bugla are ta ama makan atne mogl, ede egli ugo, na kaniga. Agl bugla are okuo ugwa i, bre yogagle suo, sipsip nagigle bre yogagle pamere mere yegl paugwa, ba ye ka dugwa i, toki podo ta ka dinabere mere kuno yegl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Ana agl bugla are ta okna moglkwa ikra kan moglko, agl bugla are kor ta ugwa i, namba podo yugwa. Agl bugla are ta komono mogl, yoba mudu bitno moglmere mere yegl, ye ama u yoba mudu bitno moglkwa. Te, ye ere mogl, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i mudu agl bugla are ta komono moglkwa i kagie kade tenaiglmedi erukwa. Agl bugla are komono i, yoba okna ye sigwa, gorabuka paugwa ba ye goglkre, ede u kor pi moglkwa ikra pre diga.<verse eid="REV 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Ana agl bugla are ta okuo ugwa i, ye kimagl tau podo podo mere ersre, yoba gumuglnomugl kamun mitna ibo doga drabie yage makandigle sinabedi eruko, doga drabie kaima yage makandigle sugwa. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14-15" style="v" sid="REV 13:14-15" />Ye agl bugla are ta komono moglkwa ikra yoba kagie kade tenaiglmedi kimagl tau mere ersre, makandigle yoba bakagl togwa. Ye bakagl tedre, ama ye di te, Agl bugla are ta yoba bainet mina sigo, goglkre, ede u kor ogwa i, ene ye kiamo ta bekio dugwa. Dugo, yoba bekigo, agl bugla are i, ye taragl kia beke yeigwa i ir pipode idre, ka dinabedi eruko, ka dugwa. Kiamo ka dugwa i, yegl dugwa, Yoba ira ta na kagna kade narekrabuka i, ene si golo dugwa. Agl bugla are taragl kane kane yegl erukwa i, God ye erabedi kanige eruko, ye erukwa.<verse eid="REV 13:14-15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Ana agl bugla are ta okuo ugwa i ere mogl, yoba mudu muno gane ta ogono wo mina mo mabro mina inaiglmiwe dugwa. Yoba yoko meglkwa mo kade meglkwa i ya te, mige moni podo kan neigwa mo goduglme meglkwa i, ya te, yene kogono erikwa mo yoba pere boino pai teigwa i pra, ye mudu muno gane inaiglmiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Te, ye di paduglkwa i, yoba muno gane i ta ikrabuka yobamo i, taragl ta topo sikre, taragl maket ama erekrabedi di paduglkwa. Muno gane i, agl bugla are ta komono ugwa i kagie mo ye kagie nambamo paugwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Okna ibo, yoba ka Grik beglkwa igne, ye namba ta boraiglkwa i ta yeikrukwa pre ye 1 boramnedi prikwa i, a mere yegl beglkwa. Te, 2 boramnedi prikwa i, b mere yegl beglkwa. Yegl pre yoba kagie leta swara swarade keribi, namba ta yenabuka.</char></note> <verse eid="REV 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Yegl pre yoba kinano gudu praiglkwa paugwa. Yoba ta nomanemo panan, ye agl bugla are nambamo kerenabuka i kuno erabuka. Nambamo i, yoba nambano paugwa. Ye nambamo i, 666 paugwa.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Yoba 144,000 ikra giglage kor ta bekigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kandre, ta ama kaniga i, sipsip nagigle ye Saion muglo ibo adigl moglko, yoba 144,000 bogl akie adigl meglkwa. Yoba i, sipsip nagigle ya, ye nem kagno akie mabro mina bogl padiglko, na kaniga.<verse eid="REV 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Kan moglsre, prika i, heven ibo gita mere yegl ta sigo, be dugo, na prika. Be dugwa i, nigl kade mu podo dumere yegl didre, kamun gur podo dumere mere yegl, ama be dugwa. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Ye taragl gita mere yegl yogwa i sidre, God siamo king yomara ya taragl 4-pela ikra meglmara ya te, bitno yagl 24-pela meglmara gumanomugl giglage kor ta digwa. Ye giglage kor ta digwa i, yoba ta beke inaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa ba makandigle yoba meglmara suna i, yoba 144,000 sipsip nagigle ye topo si ikne edugwa yobamo i keme beke inaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="REV 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Yagl keme 144,000 meglkwa i, ye abu abai bogl mabuno kide ta erekre, mabuno du keme erikwa. Ye sipsip nagigle aglo mere omara i, sika sigwa yoba meglkwa. Te, God ye topo si ikne edugwa i, ka ebrie mere yoba kaya mokna tau komono kana dogwa i, i pere ede, i pi God teigo, God taraglmo yomere mere yegl, yoba i ye mogl pere edidre, God ya sipsip nagigle yobama meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Ye ka digwa i, ka kibi dikre, mabuno erikwa i, yoba ye kenaglno sinaiglkwa mere yegl ta erekrikwa. Angelo suota ka di nogugl edigwa<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodidre, ta ama kaniga i, angelo pere ta kamun mitna ibo wogo, kaniga. Angelo i, ye God kamo wakai, aimadi kamun yenabuka i, makandigle yoba mudu di tenagledi idre, ede ogwa. Yoba kantri pere pere moglsre, yugobuno pere pere mogl, kano pere pere paugwa meglkwa i, mudu di tenagledi pidre, <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />ka podo yegl dugwa, Ene God kuduglmo goglsre, ye debie sio! I siragl pre ye yoba ka tage tenabuka igne i u kodumiwe dugwa. Ye swara kamun mitna ibo ya dumo makan ere yedre, mudi nigl ya nigl kor ogo beigwa i, ere yogwa pre ene ye swara kagie kade teo! di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ana angelo i yegl di kodugo, angelo ta ama ye mokomugl udre, yegl dugwa, Dumo kade Babilon i, u kide pi kodumiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 21.9</char></note> dugwa. Yoba ta ere mogl, yoba ta spak erabedi nigl wain teimere mere yegl, Babilon yoba meglkwa i, ye mabuno kide yoba uglo koglo koglo yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i beke teigwa yobamo meglmiwa. Ye yoba kumugl abai ya yagl abu ta bogl mabuno kide eraiglmedi beke teimiwa. Beke teigwa ba erme dumo i, u kide pi kodumiwe di, angelo namba 2 i, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Ana angelo suo i u ka yegl di kodibriko, angelo namba 3 ye moknomugl udre, ka podo yegl dugwa, Yoba ta agl bugla are ikra ye kiamo kagie kade tenabo mo, ye muno ganemo mabuglo mina mo ogo mina inabuka i, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />God ye dem podo kubrabuka i, inabiwe dugwa. Inabuka i, nigl wain, nigl kor bogl suru mix erekriko, gigle dumere mere yegl, God yoba mitno goglkre, ka gigledi tage tenan, inaiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:10">Sipsip nagigle yene angeloma bogl kan meglbi, yoba i doga ya kobuglo de pamara i mina doga de, giugl podo praiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Yoba ta agl bugla are i mo ye kiamo i kagie kade tedre, ye kagie muno gane mere yegl ta inaiglkwa i, ye doga dedre, giugl praiglkwa i, ege ege etne ya eduer bu yeikran, pre pai meglbi, ede inge aimadi kamin ede egli enabiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Taragl yegl okuo plau dinabuka pre God yobama ye yegl erabedi sugl moraiglkwa paugwa. God yobama i, ye God kamo duglo boglsre, Jisas pre medigl pai meglkwa yoba i pre diga.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kan kodigo, yoba ta heven ibo moglsre, ka ta dugo, na prika. Ye ka dugwa i, Ene yegl boglo! dugwa. Erme ya okuo pra, yoba ta Yagl Kade pre mediglsre, gorabuka i, ye gun yenabiwe di, yegl boglo dugwa. Yegl dugo, God Murubuglomo yegl dugwa, Owo, yoba i kogon podo ersre, giugl prikwa i dudinan, ye wakan moraiglkwa paugwa. I siragl pre ye taragl ta idre, ede God moglmara unaiglkwa i, ye kogon wakai siragl mere erikwa i, idre, ede unaigkwa mere yegl pamiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaya mokna si yunaiglkwa ege yogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ana okuo na kaniga i, kamun kua kruo ta paugo, yoba ta Yoba Wam mere yegl moglmedi kaniga ikra, ye kamun kua tebe i, ame di moglko, na kaniga. Ye king bre gagl ta gol mina bekigwa i, bre mina edidre, di kuba nogwa ta ogo mina ake moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Ye kamun kua tebe ame di moglko, angelo kor ta God yugumo yomara ede meda udre, ye yagl ta kamun kua tebe ame di moglkwa i ka podo di te, yegl dugwa, Kugl makandigle paigwa i, mogono de kodugwa pre erme ene di kubanen mina sinatnga ege yomiwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Angelo i yegl dugo, yoba ta kamun kua tebe ame di moglkwa i, magididre, kugl mogo makandigle paugwa i, di kuba mina si yugwa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Taragl yegl plau dugo, angelo pere ta ama God yugumo, heven ibo yomara i mogl, di kuba nogwa ta akidre, ede meda ugwa. <verse eid="REV 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Angelo i ede meda ugo, angelo pere ta bogl kiglmara doga sugl moglkwa i, ye bogl kiglmara kide kodo, ede meda u angelo ta di kuba nogwa ake moglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Wain mogo makandigle paugwa i, bogl yogwa pre ene di kubanen nogwa i mina si inatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Yegl dugwa pre angelo ta di kuba ake moglkwa i magididre, ede wain mogo makandigle kogl paigwa i di kuba mina si idre, pia si wain mogo egrimara dumo kade i edugwa. Wain mogo egrimara dumo i, God ye dem kubro tenabuka dumo mere yegl yogwa. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Dumo i, taun kade yomara meda kra yogwa. Angelo i wain mogo pia si suna edugo, ye wain mogo i egrikwa. Egriko, bormai mere kide ede meda pi, nigl mere yegl ede wogwa. Bormai i, ake wai di ede eglke ogwa i, 300 kilomita mere yegl ogwa. Ana ede egli ugwa, hos ta adigl moran, u dra mina unabere mere yegl sige yogwa.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Angelo 7 ye plet 7-pela gol mina bekigwa i, akigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Ana na taragl ta ama kaniga, heven ibo diu podo ta eruko, na wai kugl, kan moglko, angelo 7-pela ibun 7-pela ake meglko, kaniga. Ye yubun 7-pela makadigle yoba tebi, dudinan, mokomugl i ibun ta ukrabuka. I siragl pre God dem podo kubrukwa i, ibun 7-pela i mina i nogugl edenan, dudunabuka.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Te, na taragl ta ama kaniga i, mudi nigl mere yegl ta moglko, kaniga. Mudi nigl mere yegl ta moglmedi kaniga ba i mudi nigl moglkrukwa. Taragl glas mere yegl ta yogo, yomara suna ibo ama doga bauglo erukwa mere yegl kaniga. Te, taragl i tebe bolamugl i, yoba tau adigl moglsre, taragl gita mere yegl ta God ye togwa i, ake meglko, na kaniga. Yoba adigl meglko, kaniga i, ye agl bugla are ikra kagie kade tekre, ye kiamo beke padiglkwa paugwa i ama kagie kade tekre, te ye nambamo ama muno gane mere yegl ta ikre, yegl erikwa pre ye kuda yobuglo erikwa mere yegl paugwa.<verse eid="REV 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />Ana yoba i adigl moglsre, giglage ta digwa. Giglage i, God niglmo kogonmo yoba Moses ikra, okna giglage dumere mere yegl didre, sipsip nagigle kagie kade tenamnedi giglage digwa. Ye giglage digwa i, yegl digwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Yagl Kade God yo, ene yobugln pai kawa togwa motnga i,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Ene kogon podo kide etngo, no kandre, nagino podo kunga.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ene ye kingno moglsre,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">mabuno du ya mabuno kaima keme etnga.<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ene swara den mudun pe kaima sugwa motnga pre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Yoba mudu ene kuduglnen goglsre, kagn kade tenaiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Ene mabuno du keme ersre, yoba kot ere tenga i, i nogugl edinga pre</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, ene motnara udre, kagn kade tenaiglmiwe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 86.9, 98.2, 111.2-3, Lo 32.4, Jeremaia 10.7</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="REV 15:4">di, giglage yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Ana okuo na kaniga i, God sel yugumo heven ibo yogwa i, dua yauro edigo, kaniga. God sel yugumo i, God lomo yugugl yogwa. <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />Sel yugu i dua yauriko, angelo 7-pela ye yubun 7-pela makandigle yoba tenamnedi ake meglkwa i, ede meda wigwa. Ye kugugl gagl kruo, pe kaima sugwa edidre, kumagl gol mina bekigwa i, dano bage de prak sigwa. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Ana taragl 4-pela sia king yomara meglkwa ikra, swarano ta plet 7-pela gol mina bekigwa i ake moglsre, angelo 7-pela i togo, ye igwa. God kor aimadi moglkwa i, ye dem kubrukwa i, plet 7-pela i mina atne kau sugwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Ana angelo 7-pela i ye plet igo, God ye abuglagemo podo sugo, yobuglomo podo kaima paugwa moglkwa i, ede inge ye moglmara ede egli pi, ye yugumo yugugl ake wai di, kau kaima sugwa. Te, yoba mo angelo ta ede God yugumo yugugl iro enaiglkwa i, kuno erekrukwa. Ye sugl meglbi, angelo 7-pela i ye yubun 7-pela ikra makandigle yoba te kodibi, ye okuo ede yugugl enaiglkwa paugwa.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Angelo 7 ye plet 7-pela toide makandigle edigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />
    <figure style="fig" alt="Bowl of Wrath" file="HK0035A_Bowl of Wrath.tif" size="col" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="16.1" />Ana okuo God yugumo yugugl kra i, yoba ta ka podo di meda edidre, angelo 7-pela ikra yegl di togwa, Ene God dem kubrukwa plet 7-pela mina ake meglkwa i, i pi toide makandigle edio dugwa. <verse eid="REV 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Yegl dugo, angelo namba 1 moglkwa i, ye plet ta ake moglkwa ikra, i pi toide makandigle edugo, yoba ta agl bugla are muno ganemo idre, ye kiamo kagie kade teigwa i, ogono nagino mina, num kide kaima, giu kide erukwa num i, deigwa.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ana angelo namba 2 plet ake moglkwa ikra i pi toide mudi nigl edugo, mudi nigl ede u yoba geglkwa bormaino mere yegl ogwa. Mudi nigl ede u bormai ogo, taragl ta mudi nigl atne meglkwa i, mudu geglkwa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ana angelo namba 3 plet ake moglkwa ikra i pi toide nigl ta ogo bei wimara ya nigl bage bage wimara i edugo, nigl mudu u bormai koglo eigwa. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />U bormai koglo eigo, angelo ta nigl bage bage sugl moglkwa i, yegl dugwa, God yo, ene den mudu pe kaima sugwa te, ene okna aimadi moglsre, erme mogl pai motnga i, ene makandigle yoba yubun yegl tenga i, mabuno du ersre, teniwa. <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />I siragl pre ene yobanma ya kanen kep yoba ye si gogl, bormaino toide i meda edigwa i, ene ere mogl, ye bormai kogl nenaiglmedi tenga. Ye inaiglkwa pamara i, te ikne ediniwe di, yegl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Angelo i yegl dugo, yoba heven ibo tawa bogl ta yogo, meglkwa i, yegl digwa, Yagl Kade God yo, yobugln pai kawa togwa motnga i, ene yoba ka tage tenga i, mabuno du ya mabuno kaima keme etniwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ana angelo namba 4 ye plet ake moglkwa ikra i pi toide ade mina edugo, God ere mogl, ade niga podo dinan, yoba ade podo denaiglmedi erukwa. Ye ade podo deigwa i, doga mere yegl deigwa. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Ade niga podo kide dogo, yoba ade dedre, God kagie di kide yei teigwa. God ye yubun i dedenabuka mo dedekrabuka mo i, ye wagle paugwa ba yoba i nomane yake tedre, God kagie kade tenaiglkwa i kodo, ye kagie di kide yei teigwa.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ana angelo namba 5 ye plet ake moglkwa ikra, i pi toide agl bugla are ikra sia kingmo mina tebe edugwa. Toide edugo, agl bugla are dumo ta sugl moglmara i, mudu mim eruko, yoba ama giugl podo prisre, yene drano giugl kaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />Yegl ersre, ye num dedre, giugl pre, erikwa i pre God heven ibo moglkwa i, di kide yei teigwa. Ye nomane yake tedre, mabunono kide, kide kodinaiglkwa i, kodo, ye ere pai meglkwa.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ana angelo namba 6 ye plet ake moglkwa ikra i pi toide nigl kade ta, kagie Yufretis we digwa womara i edugo, nigl i dare ede atne pi kodugwa. I siragl pre king tau ade umara kra meglkwa i, unaiglmedi pre God ye nigl i darenabedi erukwa.<verse eid="REV 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Ana na taragl ta ama kaniga i, murubuglo kide suota koglko mere yegl meglko, na kaniga. Murubuglo kide swara ta toki podo ikra dra mina meda ugo, te ta agl bugla are ikra dra mina meda ugo, ta ama agl bugla are kamo kep yagl, ka kibi dugwa ikra dra mina meda ugo, erukwa.<verse eid="REV 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Armagedon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />King dumo uglo koglo koglo meglmara i, murubuglo kide pidre, kimagl tau ersre, king auro yunamnedi eigwa. Ye pi auro yunamnedi erikwa i, God ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa moglkwa i, egemo kade unan, king i God kuda bogl tenaiglmedi pre pi, di makai sigwa. <verse eid="REV 16:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="REV 16:15-16" />Ye king i amino bogl auro yu, dumo ta ka Hibru mina kagie Armagedon we dimara i, edigo, na kaniga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 16:15-16">Na taragl yegl mere kan moglko, Yagl Kade ama ka yegl dugwa, Ene prio. Na unaglka i, kunogl gogl yoba ede yugugl ugo, yugu nem kandre, wai kuglmere mere yegl, na unaglka. Yoba ta ugl paikre, kuguglmo gaglmo ede, kor wan moglmere mere yegl ta morabuka i, ye gun yenabuka. Ba yoba ta kuguglmo gaglmo edekre, yokoko wan moglmere mere yegl ta morabuka i, yoba ye toromo kanibi, ye agai gorabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 16:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ana angelo namba 7 ye plet ake moglkwa ikra toide kamun mitna ibo edugo, God yugumo yugugl kra ime, sia king yomara i, yoba ta ka podo di, I dudumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Yegl dugo, kamun gur di moglko, mu podo dugo, kamun tai ama sugo, imem podo kide kaima ta ama ugwa. Imem i, yoba koragle dumo makan mina meglkwa igne ede u erme pra, imem podo kide yegl ta ukrumere mere yegl ugwa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Imem podo kide yegl ugwa pre siti kade Babilon i, buko di ede bage suota ogo, yugobuno pere pere sitino kade ama si deduagle erukwa. Babilon yoba kagno paugwa i, God pre moglsre, ye dem podo kubrukwa i, wain gigledi moglkwa i nenaiglmedi togwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Te, imem podo kide yegl mere ugwa pre ailan bage bage yogwa i, mudu imin daiglko, muglo meglbi ama yage sigwa. <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />Te, aragl mogo podo kide kaima ama yage sugwa. Mogo swara swarade yubunmo 50kg mere yegl heven ibo yei, yage, yoba si geglkwa ba yoba tau kor meglkwa i, God kagie di kide yei teigwa. I siragl pre God ye yubun tedre, aragl mogo yage sinabedi erukwa i, yubun podo kide togwa pre ye kagie di kide yei teigwa.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Abu ta agl bugla are au si moglkwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Ana angelo 7-pela ye plet ake meglkwa ikra swarano ta na moglmara udre, Ene ede wo! dugwa. Ene un, na taragl ta ene obuno di tenaglka. Konbauna abu ta mabuno kide mina ede okna pidre, nigl bage bage meglmara tebe ame di moglkwa i, God ye siragl mere ka tage tenabuka i, na ene obuno di tebo, kanatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />King makandigle meglkwa i, ye abu i bogl mabuno kide eriko, te, makandigle yoba ama ye bogl mabuno kide ersre, du erikwa. Yoba nigl wain nedre, spak erimere mere yegl, ye du erimiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Dugo, God Murubuglomo na moglmara si kau si naruko, angelo i na auro i pi dumo wau yomara edugo, na abu ta moglko, kaniga. Abu i, ye agl bugla are ta, nagie gogl koglkwa, bolamugl au si moglkwa. Agl bugla are i nagie mina, kagie kane kane bogl padiglkwa paugwa. Ye kagie kane kane i, mem paugwa, God ka kide di teigwa mere yegl paugwa. Te, ye bre 7-pela koglsre, bre yogagle 10-pela ama koglkwa. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Abu i, kugugl gagl edumara i, kala gogl kaima ya gogl mere yegl yogwa edugwa. Te, taragl gol mina bekigwa ya kobuglo tau mige podo boglkwa i edidre, bis nugu tau mige podo boglkwa i ama togugwa. Te, ye ogo mina kap ta gol mina bekigwa i, ake moglkwa. Kap i mina, ye mabuno kide ya mabuno deglbi kane kane erukwa i, atne kau sugwa mere yegl paugwa. <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />Te, ye mabuglo mina kagie ta beglkwa paugwa. Kagie i, mem atne kaima paugwa. Ye kagie beglkwa i, yegl beglkwa, Dumo Kade Babilon, ye makandigle yoba ta konbauna abu meglkwa i mo mabuno kide, deglbi yogwa erikwa i, mano moglmiwe di, yegl beglkwa. <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Te, na kaniga i, abu i ye God yobama meglkwa i ya yoba Jisas kamo di nogugl edigwa i, si goglsre, bormaino mina spak erukwa mere yegl pamedi kaniga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Na abu i kandre, nagna podo koglko, <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />angelo i na di pre, Ene siragl pre nagn koglne? dugwa. Abu ta agl bugla are au sugwa i ya te, agl bugla ye bre 7-pela koglsre, bre yogagle 10-pela koglko, ene kanga i, mabunomo atne paugwa ba na ene di tebo, pratniwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Ene agl bugla ta kanga i, okna moglsre, erme moglkrukwa ba ye kuri ta mogl, makan mur ta ede atne kaima omara ime mogl, ede egli unabuka. Ede egli udre, okuo ye u kide enabara enabiwe dugwa. Ye ede egli unan, makandigle yoba ye kandre, nagino koraiglkwa. Makandigle yoba i, God ye okna ibo, dumo makan ere yeikrukwa igne yoba ta kagno ye aimadi kor moraiglkwa bukmo mina bogl atne edekrukwa meglkwa i pre diga. Yoba i nagino koraiglkwa i, siragl pre agl bugla i okna moglkwa, erme moglkrukwa ba okuo aglke kor u plau dinabiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />Angelo i yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ka erme dinaglka i, yoba ta nomanemo wakai panan, ye pre pogl sinabuka kuno erabiwe dugwa. Agl bugla are bre 7-pela koglkwa i, muglo meglbi 7-pela i nogugl edugwa. Te, abu ikra, ye muglo meglbi 7-pela i mina ame di moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Bre 7-pela i, mem suo paugwa. Ta, muglo meglbi 7-pela i nogugl edigwa. Te, ta, king 7-pela ama i nogugl edugwa. King 7-pela i, 5-pela geglko, swara ta erme moglkwa. Te, swara ta ukrukwa ba ye unan, ye ege sugunagle keme morabuka paugwa. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Te, agl bugla ta okna moglsre, erme moglkrukwa i, ye king namba 8 ta morabuka. Ye 7-pela meglmara i mina udre, okuo ede pi ye u kide enabara enabiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />Ana angelo i ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl dugwa, Agl bugla are bre yogagle 10-pela koglko, kanga i, king 10-pela i nogugl edigwa. King i, erme king moglkre, dumo ta sugl moglkrikwa ba ye okuo agl bugla are i bogl kagno kade idre, ege sugunagle wan aua mere yegl king moraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />King 10-pela i ye nomano swara yedre, yobuglno ya kagno kade i swara ede, agl bugla i tenaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Te, king 10-pela i ama sipsip nagigle kuda bogl tenaiglkwa ba sipsip nagigle ye yobuglo ere tenabuka. I siragl pre sipsip nagigle i, ye yoba kade makandigle meglkwa i Yaglno Kade moglsre, king makandigle meglkwa i Kingno moglkwa. Te, sipsip nagigle yoba ta agle didre, kere yugo, kamo mina adigl gigledi meglkwa i, ye bogl akie moraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Angelo i yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Konbauna abu ta kanga ikra ye nigl bage bage meglmara i, tebe ame di moglkwa. Nigl i, makandigle yoba mere kide, kantri pere pere moglsre, ka pere pere digwa i, i nogugl edugwa. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Agla bugla are i ya bre yogagle 10-pela kanga i, ye ere mogl, konbauna abu i kide pre tedre, ye sidre, bona ganamo mudu ibi, ye yokoko morabuka. Yokoko moran, ye ogo nagie nedre, si doga mina edibi, de tege erabuka. <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />King 10-pela ye konbauna abu ere kide ere tenaiglkwa i, God ye eraiglmedi prukwa pre ye mabuno yegl ere tenaiglkwa. God ye yegl eraiglmedi prukwa pre nomane tenan, ye nomano swara yedre, dumo sugl meglkwa i, mudu agl bugla are ikra sugl morabedi tenaiglkwa. Ye dumono agl bugla are i tedre, ye moglmara atne mogl ebi, God kamo mudu plau di kodinabuka. <verse eid="REV 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />Te, konbauna abu ta kanga i, ye ka ebrie mere siti ta i nogugl edugwa. Siti i, siti kade ta yei mitna ede, siti tau king makandigle meglkwa i, mudu egre atne edugwa, i nogugl edumiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Dumo Babilon u kide pi kodugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Ana okuo, angelo pere ta heven ibo kide kodo, ede atne ugo, na kaniga. Angelo i, kagie kade paugo, ama abuglagemo podo sugwa pre makandigle pogl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Angelo i ede atne udre, ka podo yegl dugwa, Dumo kade Babilon i, u kide pi kodumiwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 21.9</char></note>. U kide pi kodugo, erme murubuglo kide kane kane dumo i kipai meglbi, kua kide ya dua kabu kide, yoba i pi God tawa gagl tenaiglkwa kuno erekrukwa meglkwa i, ama dumo Babilon moraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />Yoba spak erabedi nigl wain teimere mere yegl, Babilon yoba i, yoba uglo koglo koglo yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, kumugl abai ya yagl abu ta bogl mabuno kide eraiglmedi kinano sigwa. Yegl eriko, te king makandigle meglkwa i, ye Babilon yoba bogl ama mabuno kide eriko, Babilon yoba ye taragl kane kane idre, ame wakai kaima dinamnedi bubuno geglkwa pre bisnis man mige moni podo igwa. Yegl erikwa pre God ye ere kide ere tomiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Di kodugo, yoba pere ta heven ibo mogl, ka ta dugo, prika. Ka yegl dugwa, Ene na yobanama meglkwa i, ene dumo Babilon kide kodo, teke ede meda pio!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jeremaia 51.45</char></note> dugwa. Ta manan, ene Babilon yoba tadaglme erimere yegl eraiglmiwa. Ye erimere mere yegl eribi, na ye yubun tenaglka i, ene ama akie i dinaiglkwa pre diwa. <verse eid="REV 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />I siragl pre Babilon yoba tadaglme ere br si meglko, br i ede mitna heven ibo ogwa mere yegl paugwa. Ye mabuno kide erikwa i, God pre moglsre, ka tage tenabuka pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Ye yoba pere ta mabuno kide ere teimere kuno yegl mere ene ye ere ikne ede teo! dugwa. Te, ye mabuno kide swara swarade erikwa i, ene ege suo mere ere kide ere te ikne edio. Ye nigl kide kap swara mina koglsre, yoba pere teigwa i, ene kap suo mere kogl, te ikne edio dugwa. <verse eid="REV 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Ye bona gana podo sidre, kagie kade imere mere ye giugl prisre, kide praiglmedi ere teo. I siragl pre ye nomano mina prikwa i, No abu werai mere moglkre,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 47.7-8</char></note> abu kwin mere yegl munga pre ege swara ta kai erekramniwe di prikwa. <verse eid="REV 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Ka yegl digwa pre ege swara ta yubun podo unan, ege swara i mina Babilon yoba tau geglbi, tau kai giglange sidre, kidan podo goraiglkwa. Yagl Kade God ye ka tage togwa pre ye dumono doga denabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Ana king makandigle meglkwa, ye Babilon yoba bogl mabuno kide ersre, taragl kane kane bubuno gogl, ame wakai digwa yoba ikra, dumo Babilon i doga denan, ede inge ede egli enabuka i, ye kanaiglkwa igne, kide pre, kai podo eraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />Ye Babilon ka podo tage yumere mere yegl ama i dinamnedi kudugl gogl, eglke iro adigl moglsre, yegl dinaiglkwa, Aiye, kodo! Dumo kade Babilon, dumo gigledi yogwa ba ege sugunagle, wan aua mina, God dumo i ka tage te kodumiwe di, yegl dinaiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Ana ka yegl dibi, makandigle yoba taragl podo podo i pi dumo Babilon maket ere neigwa yoba i, ama Babilon u kide ogwa i pre kide prisre, kaimo eraiglkwa. I siragl pre ye taragl kane kane i pi maket eribi, topo sinaiglkwa yobamo ta moglkrikwa i pre kai eraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />Ye taragl maket erikwa i, gol ya silva ya kobuglo tau mige podo boglkwa i maket ersre, bis nuguno mige podo boglkwa ya lap kruo, wakai kaima yogwa i maket erikwa. Ye taragl yegl maket ersre, ama lap gogl kaima ya gogl mere ta maket ersre, lap silk mina bekigwa i ama maket ersre, ede kane kane ta demene wakai erikwa i maket erikwa. Te, taragl kane kane elefan signo mina bekidre, ede tau mige podo boglkwa i mina bekigwa i, maket ersre, taragl ain mo ain bras mo kobuglo ta kruo kama suna suna paugwa i mina bekigwa i, ye maket erikwa. <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />Bisnis man ye taragl yegl mere maket ersre, ama sinamon ya sup kane kane yoba kaya mokna mina garaiglkwa i, maket ersre, ede nuglo myr ya frankinsens ya ede nuglo tau ama demene wakai erikwa i, maket erikwa. Te, ye ama nigl wain ya oliv nuglo maket ersre, plaua wakai yogwa ya wit ya kau ya sipsip maket ersre, hos ya karis maket erikwa. Taragl kane kane yegl maket ersre, te yoba kiano bogl meglmiba nigl kogon yoba moraiglmedi ama akie maket erikwa ba yoba ta topo sinaiglkwa i, ta moglkrikwa pre ye kai eraiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Bisnis man i, ye kai ersre, ama yegl dinaiglkwa, Yoba taragl wakai dumo Babilon inamnedi praiglkwa i, dudugwa. Bona gana ya mige moni ya taragl wakai wakai dumo Babilon yogwa i, mudu wau boglkwa pre okuo ta yenan, kankraiglmiwe dinaiglkwa.<figure style="fig" alt="Ship unloading cargo" file="hk00214b.tif" size="span" loc="18.12-14" copy="Horace Knowles, British Foreign and Bible Society" ref="18.14">Ol bisnisman i gat ol kain kain gutpela kago. (18.12-14)</figure> <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Bisnis man ye okna taragl kane kane maket ersre, mige moni podo igwa yobamo i, erme Babilon yoba giugl podo prikwa i kandre, no ama giugl yegl i dinamnedi kudugl gogl, eglke iro adigl moglsre, kide pre, kai eraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />Kai ersre, ama yegl dinaiglkwa, Babilon yoba wakai kaima meglkwa i, ye okna kugugl gagl kruo, wakai kaima yogwa i edidre, kugugl gagl gogl kaima ya gogl mere yegl ta edidre, gol ya kobuglo tau mige podo boglkwa ya bis nuguno mige podo boglkwa i edigwa ba erme yubun idre, u kide pi kodigwa. <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Ege sugunagle, wan aua mina ye migeno ya bona ganano podo yogwa i, u kide pidre, dudu kodumiwe di, yegl didre, kai eraiglkwa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Ana na ama kaniga i, sip akigwa yoba meglkwa i, ya yoba sip mina wanigwa ya sip mina kogon erikwa i, yoba mudu mudi nigl mina bisnis erikwa i bogl akie eglke iro adigl moglsre, <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />ede inge dumo Babilon ede egli ogwa i kandre, ka podo yegl digwa, Dumo Babilon yomere mere yegl, taun swara yegl ta yeikrume digwa. <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Ye makan kugane wobro bitno mina edidre, dumo Babilon mirie gogl, kai ersre, yegl digwa, Dumo kade ikra, u kide pi kodidre, yubun podo yumiwa. Sip nem yagl ta meglkwa i, ye mudu dumo Babilon migemo ya bona ganamo i mina ye mige moni podo igwa ba erme dumo kade i, wan aua mina u kide pi kodumiwe di, yegl digwa.<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Ene yoba heven ibo meglkwa i, God yobama ya ye dedugwa yoba ya kamo kep yoba meglkwa i, ene gun yeo! I siragl pre Babilon yoba okna ene ere kide ere teigwa i, God kan moglkwa pre erme ka tage tedre, ere ikne ede tomiwe, di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Ana taragl i plau dugo, mokomugl i angelo gigledi ta moglkwa i, kobuglo ta kugl wit si deduagle erikwa yomere yegl, podo kide ta ake mitna ede, pia si mudi nigl atne edugwa. Edidre, yegl dugwa, Na kobuglo pia si atne edimere mere yegl, God dumo Babilon yegl mere muglkude kaima si atne edenan, okuo ta yeikrabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Dumo Babilon i, okuo yoba ta mogl, taragl gita mere yegl sidre, pu mige ya biugel sidre, giglage ta dikraiglkwa. Te, yoba ta taragl ta maket eramnedi bekekribi, yoba ta ama kugl mogo si deduagle erekraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />Dumo Babilon wau yenan, yoba okuo dumo i, ken lam ta gaglkraiglkwa. Te, yagl abu ta bogl idre, gun yei, ka dinaiglkwa i ama okuo ta manabuka. I siragl pre Babilon yoba ebrie mabunono mina ya ka dimara mina nibine mere yegl didre, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, bakagl teigo, bisnis man dumo Babilon meglkwa i, u yoba yaglno kade kaima eigwa. <verse eid="REV 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Babilon yoba i, ye God kamo kep yoba ya God yobama si geglkwa pre God kide kanugwa. God kanugwa i, yoba mudu ta makandigle moglsre, yoba pere ta si geglkwa i, God ye dumo Babilon swara mabuno moglkwa mere yegl kanugwa pre ye dumo Babilon ere kide ere tenabiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="s">Dumo Babilon u kide ogwa i pre yoba gun yeigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Ana okuo na prika i, yoba mere kide heven ibo mogl, ka ta digwa mere yegl prika. Ye digwa i, yegl digwa, Nono Godno kagie kade tenamga paugwa. Ye kagie podo kaima paugo, yobuglomo podo paugo, ye swara nono ere yumiwe digwa. <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />Te, God mabuno du ya mabuno kaima keme ersre, yoba ka tage togwa pre kagie kade tenamga pamiwa. Konbauna abu ta mabuno kide mina ede okna pidre, yoba uglo koglo koglo meglkwa i, mabuno kide ersre, u kide enaiglmedi erukwa abu ikra we, ye ka tage tomiwa. Te, abu i, ye okna God niglmo kogonmo yoba si goglkwa i pre erme God ere ikne ede tomiwe digwa.<verse eid="REV 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Ye ka yegl didre, aglke kor God kagie kade tenamniwe digwa. I siragl pre God dumo Babilon ere kide ere tedre, si gaglkwa, ede inge ede egli ugwa i, aimadi kamin u pai morabiwe digwa.<verse eid="REV 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Digo, bitno yagl 24-pela meglkwa ikra ya taragl 4-pela meglkwa ikra yage kobragai padre, God sia king mina ame di moglkwa i kagie kade te, yegl digwa, Kaima. Nono God kagie kade tenamga pamiwe digwa.<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Mokomugl i, yoba ta sia king yomara moglsre, yegl dugwa, Ene God niglmo kogonmo yoba moglsre, ye kuduglmo geglkwa yobamo meglkwa i, nono Godno kagie kade teo! dugwa. Ene yoba kade meglkwa mo yoba yoko meglkwa mo i pra, ye kagie kade teo! di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sipsip nagigle ye ebie yugo, kaya mokna podo neigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Dugo, yoba mere kide ka ta digo, na prika. Ye ka digwa i, nigl podo ta mu dumere mere mo kamun gur podo dumere mere yegl, ka podo didre, yegl digwa, Nono Yaglno Kade God, ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa moglkwa i, kagie kade tenamga paugwa. I siragl pre ye taragl kane kane bitno moglmiwe digwa. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="REV 19:7-8" />Nono gun podo yedre, ye debie sinamga i, siragl pre sipsip nagigle ye abu inabuka igne i u kodugo, God ye ebie kugugl gagl kruo, wakai kaima, pe sugwa i edenabedi togo, abu i yene ere wakai ersre, sugl moglmiwe digwa. Ana kugugl gagl kruo i, God yobama mabuno du erikwa i, i nogugl edugwa.<verse eid="REV 19:7-8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Ka yegl di kodigo, angelo ta di nare, Ka ta dibo, boratne dugwa. Sipsip nagigle ye ebie bogl, bogl ibrika pre kaya mokna podo keigo, God ye yoba ta akie nenaiglmedi agle dugwa yobamo i, gun yenaiglmiwe di, yegl boglo dugwa. Didre, na ama di nare, Na ka diga magigl i, God kamo kaima yomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Angelo i yegl dugo, na ye kagie kade tenagledi kagle mina yage kobragai paiga ba ye di nare, Yegl ta erekro! dugwa. Na ene bogl akie God niglmo kogonmo yoba mugliwa. Te, ene agiglnma tau Jisas kamo ake gi di mogl, yoba pere di teigwa i, ye bogl ama akie nigl kogon yoba keme muniwa. God Murubuglomo yoba si kau si togo, ka kep ere digwa i, ye Jisas kamo swara dinaiglmedi pre erukwa. Yegl pre ene na kagna kade narekre, God swara kagie kade to dugwa.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas ede ikne ugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Ana okuo na kaniga i, heven ibo ede u koglo koglo ogo, yagl ta hos kruo au si moglko, na kaniga. Yagl ta hos kruo au sugwa i, ye kagie suo ye teigwa. Kagie i, Ka Kaima Keme Dugwa te, Ka Dumara Adigl Moglkwa Yagle. Ye yoba ka tage tedre, kuda bogl togwa i, mabuno du keme ersre, ere togwa. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Ye gumuglo i, doga bauglo abuglage sumere mere yegl abuglage sugo, ye bre mina king bitno gagl tau mere edugwa. Te, ye ogo nagie mina kagie ta beglkwa paugwa ba ye kagie i, yoba mudu ta pre pogl sikrikwa. Yene swara pre pogl sugwa. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ye gagl olto ta edugwa i, bormai mina was erikwa mere yegl edugwa, te ye kagie ta God Kamo we digwa.<verse eid="REV 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Ana yagl i hos au si idre, ugo, na kandre, yoba heven ibo meglkwa i, ye ami mere yegl moglsre, hos kruo ama au si idre, ye mokomugl wigo, na kaniga. Yoba i, ye kugugl gagl kruo, pe kaima sugwa edigwa. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Ana yagl ta ye eimara ede okna ogwa ikra bainet nogwa ta dra mina ede meda ugwa. I siragl pre ye bainet i mina yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, si atne edenabuka. Ye si atne edidre, ain buglo muglbo ta ake mogl, ye suglno morabuka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Giglage 2.9</char></note> Te, God, ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa moglkwa i dem podo kubrumara i mina yoba wain mogo egrimere mere yegl, yagl i God kudamo ikne yegl egre atne edenabuka. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Ye bikie mina atne kagie ta boglsre, te tebe kugugl gagl olto edumara i bikie mina ama kagie beglkwa paugwa. Ye kagie i, king mudu Kingno ya yoba kade mudu Yaglno Kade we di, yegl beglkwa.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Na taragl yegl mere kandre, ama angelo ta ade mina suna ibo adigl moglko, na kaniga. Angelo i ka podo didre, kua mudu ta kamun mitna pur di wan meglkwa i, yegl di togwa, Ene u makai sio! God ene mie podo nenaiglmedi ere wakai ere yei tomiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />King ya ami keptan ya kuda yoba, yobuglno podo paugwa i, ogono nagino nenaiglkwa. Te, hos ya yoba hos au sigwa ya yoba kane kane, yoba pere boino pai teigwa mo yoko meglkwa i, ya te, yoba kade meglkwa i, mudu geglbi, ene ye ogono nagino ne, mie podo nenaiglmiwe di, angelo i yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Ana angelo i yegl dugo, agl bugla are ikra yogo, makandigle king meglkwa i yeigo, ye amino bogl makai sigo, na kaniga. Ye makai sigwa i, yagl ta hos kruo au si idre ugwa ikra ye amimo bogl, kuda bogl tenamnedi makai sigwa.<verse eid="REV 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Ana na kan moglko, yagl ta ugwa i, udre, agl bugla are i ya te, ye kamo kep yagl kibi ta moglkwa ikra si akidre, ye kor miurko, suo akie pia si doga kade, kobuglo de paugo, doga podo nigl nubun mere yegl domara i, edugwa. Ana ka kep kibi erukwa yagl we diga i, agl bugla are gumamugl kimagl tau ersre, te yoba ta agl bugla are muno ganemo idre, ye kiamo kagie kade tenaiglmedi bakagl togwa yagle ikra pre diga. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Ana yagl ta hos au sidre, ugwa i, ye yoba suo i si doga mina edidre, bainet ta dra mina ede meda ugwa i mina ye ami mudu u makai sigwa i si goglko, kua mudu udre, yoba geglkwa i ogono nagino ne, dano podo erukwa.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Angelo ta Satan si kane sugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Ana okuo na kaniga i, angelo ta heven ibo kide kodo, ede atne ugo, na kaniga. Angelo i, ye ki ta ake moglsre, sen kade ta ama akie ake moglkwa. Ye ki ake moglkwa i, makan mur ta yei ede atne ime ogwa i yaurnabuka pre ake moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ye ede atne udre, toki podo ikra si akidre, ye bugla yugu 1,000 kane panabedi sen mina si kane sugwa. Toki podo i, ye toki ta okna ibo moglkwa ikra moglko, ye kagie Satan we didre, Yagl Kide ama we dumga. <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />Angelo ta kaniga ikra, ye Satan si kane sidre, makan mur ta yei ede atne ime omara i pia si atne edidre, makan mur dra yomara si kegl dugwa. Ye yegl erukwa i, bugla yugu 1,000 kane pai mogl, yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, bakagl te dinabedi erukwa. Ba bugla yugu 1,000 i dudinan, ye ede meda udre, ege sugunagle keme meda wan morabuka paugwa.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Ana na ama kaniga i, sia king tau yogo, yoba tau sia mina ame di meglko, kaniga. Yoba i, God ye yoba kotno praiglmedi namba togwa. Te, na ama kaniga i, yoba tau ye Jisas kamo yoba di tedre, God kamo ake gi di meglkwa pre yoba ye nuguno si gare edigwa i, kiano mina meglko, na kaniga. Yoba i, ye agl bugla are ikra mo ye kiamo bekigwa i kagie kade tekre, ye muno ganemo ogono mo mabro mina ikrikwa meglkwa. Na kan moglko, yoba i adigl u kor pidre, bugla yugu 1,000 Krais bogl akie yoba suglno meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Ege i, yoba geglkwa tau komnaye kana adigl u kor eigwa. Ba yoba tau geglkwa i, igne i ta adiglkrikwa. Bugla yugu 1,000 i dudugo, ye mokomugl adigl u kor eigwa. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Ana yoba komnaye kana adigl u kor enaiglmara i, ye taragl wakai wakai idre, gun podo yebi, te God ye yene pre i pere edenabuka. Yoba i, namba 2 dai ikra ye ta akekrabuka ba ye tawa teigwa yoba mere yegl, God ya Krais kogono ersre, bugla yugu 1,000 Krais bogl akie yoba suglno moraiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satan ede meda udre, doga kade domara ogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Ana bugla yugu 1,000 i dudinan, Satan ye kane pai moglmara ikra kide kodo, ede meda unabuka. <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />Ye ede meda udre, yoba yugobuno pere pere uglo koglo koglo moraiglkwa i, bakagl tenabuka. Yugobuno pere pere i, kagno Gok ya Magok we dinamga. Satan ye bakagl tedre, God yobama kuda bogl tenaiglmedi i makai sinabuka. Ye i makai sinan, ye pikaugl mere yegl, mere kide kaima moraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Ana na kan moglko, yoba i uglo koglo koglo mogl udre, God yobama pai meglmara mogl winabo digwa. God yobama pai meglmara i, dumo Jerusalem, siti ta God wakai kanugwa i pre diga. Ye God yobama kuda bogl tenamnedi mogl winabo digo, doga bauglo heven ibo yei, ede atne u, ye gagl tege erukwa. <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />Gagl tege eruko, God angelomo ta ere mogl, yagl kide, ye yoba bakagl togwa i, pia si doga kade, kobuglo de paugo, doga podo nigl nubun mere yegl domara i, edugwa. Agl bugla are ikra ye kamo kep yagl kibi bogl komono kana pi, doga de miurara i edenan, ye akie giugl aimadi kamin pre pai moraiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">God yoba kot ere togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Ana okuo na kaniga i, sia king kruo, podo kide ta yogo, yoba ta sia king i mina ame di moglko, na kaniga. Te, dumo makan ya kamun mitna ibo i, ye moglmara teke pidre, imim daglkwa. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ana na ama kaniga i, yoba geglkwa, yoba kade ya yoba yoko meglkwa i pra, ye sia king yomara gumamugl adigl meglko, God buk tau, yoba mabunono buk i mina bogl atne edugwa i, pogl edugwa. Buk i poglsre, yoba geglkwa i mabuno siragl mere ta erikwa i kere kandre, ye erimere mere yegl kot ere togwa. Te, ye buk ta ama poglkwa i, yoba aimadi kamin kor moraiglkwa buk ikra ama poglkwa. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Ana igne i yoba ta geglko, ogono nagino mudi nigl atne yogwa i, adiglko, te yoba mudu ta goglsre, ede pi geglkwa yoba meglmara eigwa i, adiglko, God ye mudu mabuno siragl mere erimere yegl, kot ere tedre, <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />yoba geglkwa i ya te, ye dumo ta pai meglmara i, akie pia si doga kade ta nigl nubun mere yegl de pamara ikra atne edugwa. Yoba ta ede doga kade de pamara eigwa i, i namba 2 dai. <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />Yoba ira ta ye kagno kor moraiglkwa buk i mina atne ta paikrukwa i, God ye mudu pia si doga kade, nigl nubun mere yegl de pamara i, edugwa.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">God dumo makan ya kamun mitna ibo kor ere yogwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Ana okuo na kaniga i, dumo makan ya kamun mitna ibo erme paigwa i, imim daiglko, God dumo makan kor ya kamun mitna ibo kor ere yogwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 65.17</char></note> Te, dumo makan kor i, mudi nigl ama moglkrukwa. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Te, na ama kaniga, God sitimo, dumo Jerusalem kor i, God moglmara heven ibo yei, ede atne ugo, na kaniga. Abu ta ede yagl enabedi pre yoba ekin wakai gagl teimere mere yegl, God ye dumo Jerusalem kor i, ere wakai ere yei kodidre, ede atne edugwa. <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Ede atne edugo, yoba ta sia king yomara mogl, ka podo ta dugo, na prika. Ye yegl dugwa, Ene kanio! God sel yugumo erme yoba meglmara suna yenan, God ye yoba meglmara suna kipai moran, yoba i ye yobama moraiglkwa. God ye meglmara suna moglsre, <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />kaino nuglo ta yage sinabuka i koko ede tenabuka. Te, yoba okuo ta goglkribi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aisaia 25.8</char></note> yoba kai ersre, kai giglage sigwa ya giugl prikwa i, okuo ama ta manabuka. I siragl pre taragl kane kane okna pamere yegl ta paikrabuka. Dudumiwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Ana na taragl yegl mere kanigo, yoba ta sia king mina ame di moglkwa i, yegl dugwa, Ene kano! Na taragl mudu ere i kor ediwe dugwa. Yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na ka diga i, kaima didre, ka dimara adigl moraglka pre ene na ka dimere yegl, bogl atne edo dugwa. <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Ye yegl didre, ama na di nare, yegl dugwa, I dudumiwe dugwa. Na moglka i, na taragl mudu plau dinabedi ersre, te, na taragl mudu ama si dudiga moglka. Yoba ta nigl gorabuka i, na ye nigl ta nedre, kor aimadi morabuka nigl i, ogo beimara i kogl tebo, ye topo narekre, yoko kaima nenabiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Ye yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta kuda yobuglo erabuka i, na ye taragl kane kane tenagle diga i, tedre, ye Godmo moglbo, ye na wana mere yegl morabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Ba yoba tau ye kudugl goglsre, na pre mediglkre, yoba kide kaima ta meglkwa i ya te, yoba si goglsre, yagl abu ta bogl kunogl nedre, kumo giai erikwa yoba ya te, yoba god kibi kamage ere teigwa ya yoba ka kibi digwa mudu i, ye taragl ta inaiglkwa i, namba 2 dai ikra inaiglkwa. Namba 2 dai i, ye doga kade, kobuglo de paugo, doga podo nigl nubun mere yegl domara pi denaiglkwa i pre diwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kor ede atne ugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Ana mokomugl i, angelo 7-pela, God yubun 7-pela okuo kaima yoba tenagledi plet mina si kau sidre, ye togo, ake meglkwa ikra, swarano ta udre, na ka ta di narukwa. Ye na di nare, yegl dugwa, Ene ede wo. Un, na sipsip nagigle abu ta yugwa i, obuno di tebo, kanatniwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Ye yegl dugo, God Murubuglomo na moglmara si kau si naruko, angelo i ye na ake i pi, muglo ta yei ede mitna kaima omara i edidre, God sitimo, dumo Jerusalem, God heven ibo moglmara yei, ede atne ugwa ikra obuno di narukwa. <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />Dumo Jerusalem i, God abuglagemo mina abuglage sugwa. Abuglage sugwa i, kobuglo ta mige podo boglkwa, kagie jaspa we digwa i abuglage sumere yegl sidre, glas pogl dumere mere yegl ama pogl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Ana na dumo Jerusalem kaniga i, kobuglo togl podo ta ere winabo digo, togl dra 12-pela yogwa. Togl dra swara swarade i, Israel yoba yugobuno 12-pela meglmere i, kagno beglkwa paugwa. Te, togl dra swara swarade i, angelo swara swarade sugl kan meglkwa. <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Togl dra i, ade umara suota yogo, ade beimara ama suota yogwa. Te, nigl bre suota yogo, nigl beye ama suota yogwa. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Te, kobuglo togl ere winabo dimara i, kobuglo 12-pela komono kana padiglsre, kobuglo tau tebe yei ede kuglo eigwa. Kobuglo 12-pela i mina, sipsip nagigle dedugwa yagl 12-pela meglmere i, kagno paugwa.<verse eid="REV 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Ana angelo ta na ka di narukwa i, ye buglo sie ta gol mina bekigwa i ake moglkwa. Buglo sie i, ye dumo kade ikra ya togl dra ya te, kobuglo togl yogwa i, sie yenabuka pre yogwa. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Dumo kade i, uglo 4-pela yogo, sie olto ya sie prak kuno yogwa. Angelo i ye buglo sie mina sie yedre, kanugwa i, siemo olto ya siemo prak i, suo akie 2,200 kilomita yogwa. Te, dumo i ede mitna ogwa i, ama makanagle sie yomere yegl, kuno yogwa. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Te, angelo i ama kobuglo togl toiemo sie yedre, kanugwa i, 65 mita yogwa. Nono yoba sie yomnere mere, angelo i sie yegl mere akidre, dumo i sie yogwa.<verse eid="REV 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Ana kobuglo togl i, ye kobuglo ta kagie jaspa we digwa i mina beglkwa. Te, taun i, gol pe kaima sugwa i mina keigwa yogwa. Gol i, glas mere yegl pogl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Ana kobuglo 12-pela makandigle bogl padiglmara i, God ye wakai kaima yenabedi kobuglo kane kane mige podo boglkwa i idre, kobuglo i swara swarade ekin gagl togwa. Ana kobuglo 12-pela i, namba 1, kobuglo jaspa yogo, kobuglo namba 2 i kobuglo sapaia yogo, namba 3 i kobuglo aget yogo, namba 4 i kobuglo emeral yogo, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />kobuglo namba 5 i sadonikis yogo, kobuglo namba 6 i konilian yogo, kobuglo namba 7 i krisolait yogo, kobuglo namba 8 i beril yogo, kobuglo namba 9 i topas yogo, kobuglo namba 10 i, krisopres yogo, kobuglo namba 11 i haiasin yogo, kobuglo namba 12 i, ametis we digwa i yogwa. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Kobuglo swara swarade makandigle bogl padiglkwa i, yegl mere paigo, togl dra 12-pela swara swarade yeimara i, bis mogo pel we digwa i swara ta dua ere padiglkwa. Te, taun suna konbauna yogwa i, gol mina erikwa. Gol i, wakai kaima yei, glas mere yegl pogl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Ana na dumo Jerusalem kaniga i, God yugumo suna i ta yogo, kankrika. I siragl pre Yagl Kade God ye yobuglomo pai kawa togwa i, ya te sipsip nagigle yene taun suna miurka pre yugu ta yenabuka i ta paikrukwa. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Te, dumo i ama ade mo ba abuglage sinabrika i ta paikrukwa. I siragl pre God abuglagemo dumo i abuglage si togo, te sipsip nagigle i, dumo i ken lamo mere yegl moglkwa. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Yoba yugobuno pere pere moraiglkwa i, ye dumo Jerusalem abuglage sinabara wan meglbi, king makandigle moraiglkwa i, ye God ya sipsip nagigle kagno kade tenamnedi taragl wakai wakai i ede dumo Jerusalem suna unaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />Ana dumo i, mim ege swara ta paikrabuka pre togl dra ege swara ta yogiglkraiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />Togl dra ege ege yauro edibi, yoko yenan, yoba yugobono pere pere uglo koglo koglo moraiglkwa i, ye God ya sipsip nagigle kagno kade tenamnedi ama taragl wakai wakai i ede suna unaiglkwa. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Te, taragl deglbi yogwa ya yoba ta mabuno ta God kide kanugwa erikwa ya ka kibi digwa i ege swara ta ede suna ukraiglkwa. Yoba ta kor aimadi moraiglkwa, kagno sipsip nagigle bukmo mina paugwa yobamo i keme ede suna unaiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="s">Jon ye nigl ya ede kor moraiglkwa togwa i, kanugwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Ana okuo, angelo i ere mogl, nigl ta yoba nedre, kor aimadi moraiglkwa ikra obuno di naruko, kaniga. Nigl i, God ya sipsip nagigle sia kingno yomara ogo bei ede meda udre, glas mere yegl pogl dugwa. <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />Nigl i, dumo Jerusalem konbaunamo yomara suna ede ime pi, ede ta paimara i koglo koglo ede, suna ede ogwa. Ede i, yoba mogomo uro nebi, kor aimadi moraiglkwa. Bugla yugu swara mina, ba yomere yomere, ege 12-pela ede i mogo koglkwa. Te, ede i yaudomo, yoba yugobuno pere pere meglkwa i, idre, wakai kaima moraiglkwa pre yogwa.<verse eid="REV 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Ana God okna ibo dumo makan ere kide erumere mere yegl, dumo i mina ta erekrabuka, dudunabuka. Te, dumo Jerusalem suna i, God ya sipsip nagigle ye sia kingno suna i yenan, God niglmo kogonmo yoba ye niglmo kogonmo ersre, <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />God guma dra kanaiglkwa. Te, God kagie ye mabro mina bogl padran, panabuka. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Igne i, eduer ta yeikran, ermine keme yenabuka. Te, ken lam mo ade ta abuglage sinabuka i, ta paikrabuka. I siragl pre Yagl Kade God yene abuglage si tenabuka. Te, ye niglmo kogonmo yoba i, God bogl aimadi kamin taragl mudu ere yogwa i, bitno mogl, sugl moraiglkwa.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jisas tabre unabuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Ana angelo i ere mogl, na ka ta di nare, yegl dugwa, Ene ka mudu pitnga i, ka kaima paugwa pre kaima plau dinabuka. Te, siragl ta tabre plau dinabuka paugwa i, Yagl Kade ye niglmo kogonmo yoba pre pogl sinaiglmedi prisre, ye angelomo ta dedugo, ye u obuno di togwa. Yagl Kade i, ye ka kep yoba i Godno moglsre, kiano sugl moglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />Angelo i yegl didre, ama Jisas yegl dumiwe dugwa, Ene kano! Na tabre unaglka. God kamo ene kep ere, buk mina bogl atne edinatnga magigl i, yoba ta wakai ere prabuka yobamo i, ye gun yenabiwe di, yegl dumiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Na Jon moglka i, na ka mudu i prisre, taragl mudu i kaniga. Na pre kan ere kodidre, angelo ta taragl kane kane obuno di narukwa i, kagie kade tenagledi yage kagle mina kobragai paiga <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />ba angelo i mane didre, Yegl ta erekro! dugwa. Na ene bogl akie God niglmo kogonmo yoba muglka. Te, ene agiglnma tau, ka kep yoba meglkwa i yebi, ka buk mina magigl bogl motnga i, yoba ira ta wakai ere praiglkwa yobamo i nono God niglmo kogonmo yoba akie munga. Yegl pre ene God swara kagie kade to dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Ana angelo i ka yegl di kodidre, ama yegl di narukwa, God kamo buk mina kep ere boratnga magigl i, teke padiglkro! dugwa. I siragl pre taragl kane kane i, plau dinabuka magigl erumiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Yoba ta mabuno kide ya mabuno deglbi yogwa ta erikwa i, ye ere moraiglkwa. Te, yoba ta mabuno wakai ya mabuno du ta ere meglkwa i, ye ere moraiglkwa pamiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />Ana mokomugl i, Jisas yegl dugwa, Kanio! Na tabre unaglka. Te, na unaglka igne, na topo wakai ake idre, u yoba swara swarade mabuno wakai ta eraiglmere i, topo tenaluwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Na moglka i, na taragl mudu plau dinabedi ersre, te, na taragl mudu ama si dudinaglka moglka. Na okna ibo, taragl kane kane paikrukwa igne moglka. Te, okuo ime ama aimadi kamin moraluwe di, yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Yoba ta kuguglno gaglno nigl edigwa i, gun yenaiglmiwe dugwa. Ede ta yoba mogomo uro nedre, kor moraiglkwa ikra, God ye uro nenaiglmedi tedre, ye dumo kade ikra togl dra yenabara ede suna unaiglmedi pra we dinabiwe dugwa. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Ba yoba ta agl mere yegl meglkwa i, meda moraiglmiwe dugwa. Te, yoba ta kumo giai erikwa mo yagl abu ta bogl kunogl neigwa mo yoba pere si geglkwa mo god kibi kamage ere teigwa i ya te, yoba mudu ta ka kibi mabuno wakai pre, ka kibi digwa i, ye ama meda moraiglmiwe dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />Jisas yegl didre, ama yegl dugwa, Na Jisas moglka i, na angelona ta ka mudu pitnere mere yegl di nogugl edenan, God yobama bage bage makai sigwa i praiglmedi pre dedigo, ugwa. Te, ka kep yoba okna digwa, ede mabuno mina dre kor erumere mere yegl, Devit gawamo ta unabiwe digwa i, na moglka. Te, kugl kuri ta tagna mogl abuglage si pai moglmere yegl, na ama yegl moluwe di, Jisas yegl dugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />God Murubuglomo ya te, yoba ta ye Krais ebie mere yegl meglkwa i, ye Ede wo! digwa. Te, yoba ta buk magigl yogwa i prabuka yobamo i, ye ama Ede wo! dinabuka paugwa. Yoba ta nigl goglkwa i, unabuka paugwa. Yoba ta nigl nenagledi prabuka i, ye nigl ta nedre, kor aimadi morabuka i, topo tekre, yoko kaima nenabuka paugwa.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buk i yoba ta kerenaiglkwa Jon ka gigledi di togwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Na God kamo kep ere boglka magigl i, ene yoba ta praiglkwa i, na ene yegl di teiga, yoba ta ka tau yene prumere i suna edenan, God ye yubun tau tenabuka. Buk i mina yubun tau unabe dumere yegl, yoba i morabara God yubun yegl tenabuka pre diga. <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />Te, yoba ta ka magigl paugwa i tau i eglke edenan, God ye buk i mina taragl wakai wakai pre dugwa i, ye morabara i eglke edenabuka. Na diga i, ede ta yoba mogomo uro nebi, kor moraiglkwa ikra ye mogomo uro ne dinabedi ersre, God dumomo, siti kor ta yenabara suna i, ama taragl wakai wakai i tenabuka igne, ye ta ikrabuka pre diga.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Ana yoba ta ka i di narukwa yobamo i yegl dugwa, Na tabre unaluwe dugwa. I pra. Yagl Kade Jisas, ene ede wo.<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Nono Yaglno Kade Jisas ene yoko kaima ere wakai ere te pai morabedi prika. Kaima.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>